{"parentUuid":"1296707f-1720-457a-aea9-473063de1200","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"00403d3d-d117-4245-a480-b983c60b4583","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"if you look through all the ui redesign screens in paper https://app.paper.design/file/01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW/p-6-0 you will notice if you compare it to the current app ui that it looks almost nothing alike. few examples [Image: image.png; ref=image_844e95d4-dcd0-4df1-baed-d34e3686a8b6] [Image: file-e61eb2bff2a3a2c638f535499d76400f.png; ref=image_5374e484-543b-4b1d-a9ea-10317f9a61df] [Image: image.png; ref=image_ac882f4f-55f6-487d-bd15-caa4bece82a4] [Image: image.png; ref=image_f384c003-0f7a-46c1-8728-f8777c88f8fe] of course you will want to reference the paper file and the app ui directly to get a better understanding of the state of it. Major work must be done to get the full ui rewrite complete. what I want you to do is spread this work out accross many haiku subagents to get independent parts of the ui done and then clean up and optimize their work at the end. the end goal is to make the app look exactly like the redesigned screens in paper\n\n<t3_context version=\"1\">\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_844e95d4-dcd0-4df1-baed-d34e3686a8b6\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 1732213\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-cb51f46c-1494-4304-9afe-cbda563169b8\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_5374e484-543b-4b1d-a9ea-10317f9a61df\">\nname: file-e61eb2bff2a3a2c638f535499d76400f.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 1735555\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-30614b1b-4415-4ae6-b57e-e8b142822e76\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_ac882f4f-55f6-487d-bd15-caa4bece82a4\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 4212132\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-c9b20f26-2387-4c1e-9e2c-9808d882bb80\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_f384c003-0f7a-46c1-8728-f8777c88f8fe\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 4149507\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-5003bf57-c948-4254-a934-9523fe2dc915\n</context>\n</t3_context>\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-cb51f46c-1494-4304-9afe-cbda563169b8.png]\n\n[Attached image \"file-e61eb2bff2a3a2c638f535499d76400f.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-30614b1b-4415-4ae6-b57e-e8b142822e76.png]\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-c9b20f26-2387-4c1e-9e2c-9808d882bb80.png]\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-5003bf57-c948-4254-a934-9523fe2dc915.png]"}]},"uuid":"973dbae5-1ca0-4a9a-b1bd-55db0ca01736","timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:42:12.025Z","imagePasteIds":[7,8,9,10],"permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":95},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
