{"parentUuid":"535c1fd6-4321-4a1a-8161-c2db7c1f7c53","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDRqqnAUTPAPDkB1pR2B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Wave 1 is the foundation (fonts and tokens). Everything else depends on it, so I'll run it first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6091,"cache_read_input_tokens":139993,"output_tokens":1140,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":52},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6091,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1140,"cache_read_input_tokens":139993,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6091,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6091},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgDRqqSqKiQ4E3TGbpi6F","requestRef":"aaced9b3-cbc8-4839-9bd2-e7177ba3e22a","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a904fc26-cebe-4265-8039-335ac1fc25ce","timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:42:49.548Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"a904fc26-cebe-4265-8039-335ac1fc25ce","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDRqqnAUTPAPDkB1pR2B","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015WcksPX1Ly4hj4tfWwXGz9","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Foundation: fonts + tokens","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":false,"prompt":"Repo worktree: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304 (branch feat/glass-surface). Read AGENTS.md first and follow it. The key rules:\n- no pattern kills;\n- never touch the live library;\n- no hardcoded ports or paths;\n- targeted Biome (`bunx biome check <files>`) and `bun run typecheck` only.\n\nCONTEXT: we're rewriting the UI so it looks EXACTLY like the Paper redesign: file 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page p-6-0. Load the Paper guide first: mcp__paper__get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-instructions\"}). Then use get_basic_info, get_computed_styles and get_font_family_info with pageId \"p-6-0\". You are WAVE 1, the foundation. Several parallel agents will build the screens on top of your work, so keep it tight and correct.\n\nTASK:\n1. FONTS. Paper uses DM Sans for headings, labels and UI text; system-ui for body text in the inspector (check this in Paper); DM Mono for meta, counts and small labels; and Libre Baskerville / Georgia for quotes. Check the exact families and weights in Paper.\n   - Bundle the fonts locally, with no network font loading (local-first rule). Add `@fontsource/dm-sans` and `@fontsource/dm-mono` with `bun add` (variable versions where they exist). `@fontsource/libre-baskerville` is already installed. Import only the weights Paper uses, in the same place the existing fontsource and font imports live (find with grep).\n   - In src/App.css :root, define `--font-sans`, `--font-mono`, `--font-body` (system-ui stack) and `--font-quote`.\n   - Switch the app's DEFAULT font from Paper Mono (`--font-ui`, around App.css:35) to the Paper default. Keep `--font-ui` as an alias if needed so nothing breaks.\n   - Do NOT restyle individual components. The screen agents do that.\n2. TOKENS. Add the Paper design tokens the app is missing to :root, with values from Paper's computed styles: `--library-text-soft` (used by .item-zoom-label but undefined), `--nav-label-active`, `--row-radius`, `--card-radius`, plus any Paper colour variables you find (use mcp__paper__get_tokens if available). Set `--sidebar-width` to Paper's 232px.\n3. Don't commit. Leave the changes in the working tree; the orchestrator commits.\n\nReport: the packages added, the variables defined (with values), and the check results. Keep the report short."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6091,"cache_read_input_tokens":139993,"output_tokens":1140,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":52},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6091,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1140,"cache_read_input_tokens":139993,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6091,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6091},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_015WcksPX1Ly4hj4tfWwXGz9":{"description":"Foundation: fonts + tokens","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":false,"prompt":"Repo worktree: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304 (branch feat/glass-surface). Read AGENTS.md first and follow it. The key rules:\n- no pattern kills;\n- never touch the live library;\n- no hardcoded ports or paths;\n- targeted Biome (`bunx biome check <files>`) and `bun run typecheck` only.\n\nCONTEXT: we're rewriting the UI so it looks EXACTLY like the Paper redesign: file 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page p-6-0. Load the Paper guide first: mcp__paper__get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-instructions\"}). Then use get_basic_info, get_computed_styles and get_font_family_info with pageId \"p-6-0\". You are WAVE 1, the foundation. Several parallel agents will build the screens on top of your work, so keep it tight and correct.\n\nTASK:\n1. FONTS. Paper uses DM Sans for headings, labels and UI text; system-ui for body text in the inspector (check this in Paper); DM Mono for meta, counts and small labels; and Libre Baskerville / Georgia for quotes. Check the exact families and weights in Paper.\n   - Bundle the fonts locally, with no network font loading (local-first rule). Add `@fontsource/dm-sans` and `@fontsource/dm-mono` with `bun add` (variable versions where they exist). `@fontsource/libre-baskerville` is already installed. Import only the weights Paper uses, in the same place the existing fontsource and font imports live (find with grep).\n   - In src/App.css :root, define `--font-sans`, `--font-mono`, `--font-body` (system-ui stack) and `--font-quote`.\n   - Switch the app's DEFAULT font from Paper Mono (`--font-ui`, around App.css:35) to the Paper default. Keep `--font-ui` as an alias if needed so nothing breaks.\n   - Do NOT restyle individual components. The screen agents do that.\n2. TOKENS. Add the Paper design tokens the app is missing to :root, with values from Paper's computed styles: `--library-text-soft` (used by .item-zoom-label but undefined), `--nav-label-active`, `--row-radius`, `--card-radius`, plus any Paper colour variables you find (use mcp__paper__get_tokens if available). Set `--sidebar-width` to Paper's 232px.\n3. Don't commit. Leave the changes in the working tree; the orchestrator commits.\n\nReport: the packages added, the variables defined (with values), and the check results. Keep the report short."}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgDRqqSqKiQ4E3TGbpi6F","requestRe