un git checkout/restore/stash/reset/commit. If an Edit fails because the file changed, re-read that region and retry.\n- In App.css, put your rules in one clearly commented block for your area, and delete the old rules you replace. Dead CSS is a bug.\n- Match the surrounding code style. Write comments only where intent isn't obvious. No `any`.\n- The web preview is ALREADY running at http://localhost:5173/. Don't start or kill servers. Check your work with the T3 preview tools (mcp__t3-code__preview_*): screenshot your area at 1440x900 and compare it side by side with the Paper artboard (mcp__paper__get_screenshot). Iterate until it matches. Save your final screenshot to C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\w2-<area>.png.\n- Checks: `bunx biome check <files you touched>`. Run `bun run typecheck`, but only report errors in code you touched (other agents' work is in flight).\n- If Paper needs data the app doesn't have (a palette, a video duration, disk size, the app version, a show-in-folder call, an original image on zoom), build the UI so it renders when the data exists and is hidden when it doesn't. List it in your report. A separate backend agent is adding it.\n- Keep it performant: no continuously repainting animations, and the grid stays virtualized.\n- Don't add an avatar or any account UI.\n\nREPORT (short): what you changed (file:line ranges), what still doesn't match Paper and why, check results, and the screenshot path.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Write shared wave 2 brief"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":174,"cache_read_input_tokens":150931,"output_tokens":1425,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":42},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":174,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"