{"parentUuid":"e8788216-e97e-41b9-9a11-11532da9b015","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDS8jKx6hnahEWtWhP8n","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EriVAhhA9Y7UYKRvmM5HFE","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"W2 grid + cards","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":true,"prompt":"First read C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\resurf\\BRIEF.md and follow it exactly.\n\nYOUR AREA: the GRID and every CARD TYPE (artboard 1.1 masonry). Match Paper exactly:\n- Density: about 286px columns, 12px gap, 14px inset (App.tsx ~1213-1219 target width, App.css ~610 padding). Keep the virtualization intact. The column count should still adapt to the window width.\n- Cards: no border; radius from Paper (--tile-radius or --card-radius, whichever Paper uses).\n- Article card: cream #ECE6DC, a 120px image on top, the title in 16px/600 #1A1714, and a \"domain · N min\" line in DM Mono 11px #7A7268. Right now `.library-card .card-content {display:none}` hides grid text (App.css ~1641), so articles look like untitled images. Fix that for the card kinds that need text.\n- Quote card: a 110px Georgia quote mark #C4BA8C, the FULL quote in DM Sans 18px/128% #D0C68F (no 69-char cut, App.tsx ~936; clamp generously only if it's very long), a 120px divider, and the attribution in DM Mono 10px.\n- Note and PDF cards: the title in DM Sans 21px/600 uppercase, a 10px DM Mono label, a 22px ring, 10px dots (ItemMedia.tsx 85-135, App.css ~2295-2329).\n- Video card: 190px tall, with a bottom-left glass pill holding a play glyph and the duration (DM Mono 11px). Remove the centre play disc. If no duration exists, show the pill with just the play glyph.\n- File card (and Post without data): never a blank tile. Give it a designed typed card with the extension, name and size, in the same visual language as Note/PDF. There is no Paper artboard for it, so design it consistently and report that.\n- Image card: no border.\n- Hover and selected states: keep them subtle and consistent with Paper.\nThe list view (App.css ~1951) needs to keep working; restyle its type to the new fonts.\n\nYour files: src/components/ItemMedia.tsx, the card rendering in src/App.tsx (~900-1110, ~1200-1230), and the card and grid CSS. Leave the toolbar overlay, sidebar and item view alone."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_read_input_tokens":151105,"output_tokens":4590,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4590,"cache_read_input_tokens":151105,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01EriVAhhA9Y7UYKRvmM5HFE":{"description":"W2 grid + cards","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":true,"prompt":"First read C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\resurf\\BRIEF.md and follow it exactly.\n\nYOUR AREA: the GRID and every CARD TYPE (artboard 1.1 masonry). Match Paper exactly:\n- Density: about 286px columns, 12px gap, 14px inset (App.tsx ~1213-1219 target width, App.css ~610 padding). Keep the virtualization intact. The column count should still adapt to the window width.\n- Cards: no border; radius from Paper (--tile-radius or --card-radius, whichever Paper uses).\n- Article card: cream #ECE6DC, a 120px image on top, the title in 16px/600 #1A1714, and a \"domain · N min\" line in DM Mono 11px #7A7268. Right now `.library-card .card-content {display:no