r right. Show in folder and delete call optional callbacks. Hide them when no callback is passed. Wire delete to the existing archive/delete flow if there is one, otherwise leave it hidden and report.\n- Details: three rows (Saved, From, Size); drop Type. The note box has min-height 72px. The Space chip uses the blob marker icon instead of the 6px dot.\n- Stage image: 4px radius, box-shadow 0 24px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.55).\n- Fonts: system-ui inspector text, and DM Mono for size, zoom and esc.\n- Zoom pill: keep the existing behaviour. Loading the original image on zoom is the backend agent's job.\nKeep the GSAP card flight, Esc/close, pixel zoom and note editing working.\n\nSmall, prop-only changes in App.tsx to pass data and callbacks in are allowed."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_read_input_tokens":151105,"output_tokens":4590,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4590,"cache_read_input_tokens":151105,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1456,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1456},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01JDRDVrcTrXN2fQuCZ524vq":{"description":"W2 item view","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":true,"prompt":"First read C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\resurf\\BRIEF.md and follow it exactly.\n\nYOUR AREA: the opened ITEM VIEW (artboards 2.1, 2.2 and 2.3), in src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx plus its CSS (the item-view block in src/App.css). Match Paper exactly:\