{"parentUuid":"169c4f79-2cc5-405f-84ba-03dde6e4147b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDSBhTurCMnh6ydwsBQa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm looking at the Luna backend and shared checkout constraints — it can't touch App.tsx, App.css, or components, only electron/, preload, and type definitions. I'm also weighing how harder data like palette extraction and video duration would need background jobs and DB migrations, since oEmbed doesn't expose duration and palette extraction would require image processing in a job.\n\nI recall AGENTS mentions a \"search by colors\" path, so palette data might already exist in the DB — worth having Luna verify before building new extraction logic. Ingestion changes will need accompanying tests.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6729,"cache_read_input_tokens":152561,"output_tokens":1566,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":198},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6729,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1566,"cache_read_input_tokens":152561,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6729,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6729},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5838,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgDSBh764QpzLdv9eB23f","requestRef":"3a8a16b8-6fdd-49ed-aec4-5191fce8e9ea","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"37e3ac09-0e27-4d37-997a-0b43ca4ad712","timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:47:22.962Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEff