{"parentUuid":"95d6ad1f-1694-49e8-a83e-fb5a477d13e2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDSCubSr7TXTRRBJ8i8Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The fonts and design values are in place (wave 1), but not committed yet. The Paper file uses system-ui for most of the interface text, so the default font is system-ui rather than DM Sans. DM Sans covers the headings, quotes and Settings title, DM Mono covers counts and small labels, and both are bundled with the app. The sidebar is now Paper's 232px.\n\nRunning now, all in this worktree:\n- **Five Haiku agents:**\n  1. sidebar;\n  2. toolbar and search;\n  3. grid and cards;\n  4. item view, including the Similar tab and glass back/forward on the photo;\n  5. Settings and Archive.\n\n  They share one brief: read exact values from Paper, keep to their own area, check against the preview at localhost:5173, and don't commit.\n- **One GPT-6 Luna:** the data the designs need: app version, disk size, show folder, last export, original image on zoom, colour swatches and video length. It's limited to the backend files, so it can't collide with the Haiku agents.\n\nWhen they finish, I'll have the screens hooked up to Luna's data, then run the cleanup pass and the full comparison against Paper."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2100,"cache_read_input_tokens":159290,"output_tokens":378,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2100,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":378,"cache_read_input_tokens":159290,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2100,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2100},"type":"message"}],"speed":"stan