{"parentUuid":"b17d2692-eaeb-4607-86f3-048f72b7c3d8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDSU8QJAr1NbwNSqvKWP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Main is only two commits ahead of this branch:\n\n- **`8916bef`:** redraws and animates the onboarding welcome screens.\n- **`5f93d48`:** moves the agent skills from `.agents` to `.claude`. That accounts for most of the 225 changed files.\n\nNeither one overlaps the work in progress. Onboarding isn't on the Paper redesign page and none of the agents are on it, so nothing is being redone twice.\n\nI'll merge main once the wave 2 agents finish rather than now. They're editing `App.css` and `App.tsx` uncommitted in this worktree, and main changes those two files plus `ItemMedia.tsx`. Merging mid-edit would shift the files under the agents, or leave conflict markers while they're still working in them. I'll resolve any conflicts in the merge myself, with main's onboarding changes winning in the onboarding styles.\n\nIf you meant other redesign work that has landed somewhere else (another branch or PR), point me at it and I'll stop the overlapping agents."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":474,"cache_read_input_tokens":162688,"output_tokens":797,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":462},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":474,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":797,"cache_read_input_tokens":162688,"cache_creation_input_tokens":474,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":474},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgDSU84DbUsL8xqKz9gQx","requestRef":"6d27d0e7-694e-49ae-b5a2-a36df1f33d3e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6417e24f-37cb-4e29-a186-6431aeada8c2","timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:51:08.001Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-20T11:58:22.536Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"Delegated task node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3Afe69a27e-d71d-499d-a1f1-f04b58072a79%3Adelegate-task%3Aresurf-backend-data-r1 (Redesign backend data) [completed]:\nImplemented the backend and data-layer support. I left the shared UI files untouched.\n\nRenderer APIs:\n\n- `getAppVersion(): Promise<string | undefined>` returns the desktop app version; it’s `undefined` in web preview.\n- `getLibrarySize(refresh = true): Promise<{ bytes: number } | undefined>` returns the database plus assets size. Settings can call `getLibrarySize()` to refresh; pass `false` to use the cached value.\n- `getLastExport(): Promise<{ exportedAt: number; items: number } | null | undefined>` reads the persisted last successful export; it’s `undefined` in web preview.\n- `showLibraryFolder(): Promise<boolean>` reveals the library directory.\n- `showItemInFolder(id: string): Promise<boolean>` reveals an item’s asset file, or returns `false` if it has none.\n- For zooming an image, resolve its original asset only when needed: `await assetUrl(item.localAssetPath)`. Continue using `thumbnailPath` for cards and fit-sized views.\n- `palette?: string[]` is available on stored item summaries and `LibraryItem`. It is computed from the thumbnail in a silent background job, persisted in metadata, and older images are backfilled incrementally.\n\nI found no existing video duration extraction in the video-link ingestion path. I did not add a network request or `durationSeconds`.\n\n**Checks:** Biome passed for the touched backend, bridge, and type files; `git diff --check` passed. `bun run typecheck` still reports two unused declarations in the actively edited `src/App.tsx` (`providerLabel` and `FileArtwork`). The requested Bun test run failed during Windows temporary-directory cleanup with `EBUSY`; the focused new test assertions ran, but teardown marked them failed. The combined run also showed an existing Windows path expectation failure."}
