{"parentUuid":"160f8c4d-ec17-4ca9-a7e1-2d4122b31b07","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDT2tQLx9ikY4UFa4yH2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Luna's backend work for the redesign is in the worktree, uncommitted. The screens can now get:\n\n- **Settings:** the app version, the library's size on disk, a \"Show folder\" call, and the last export date and item count, which now survive a restart.\n- **Item view:** \"show in folder\" for a single item, and the original image when you zoom in. Cards still use the thumbnail.\n- **Colour swatches:** five colours per image, worked out from the thumbnail in a background job. Older images get theirs gradually.\n\n**Video length is skipped.** The app doesn't read it when saving a video link today, and getting it would mean a new network request, which the local-first rule rules out. Video cards will show the play pill without a length.\n\n**One thing isn't clean:** Luna's new tests failed when cleaning up their Windows temp folders. The test checks themselves passed, but I'll get that fixed before anything is committed. The same run also hit a failure in an existing test that expects a different Windows path, which I'll look at too.\n\nThe five Haiku agents are still working. Once they finish, I'll merge main, hook the screens up to this data, and run the cleanup and comparison against Paper."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1540,"cache_read_input_tokens":163162,"output_tokens":410,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":35},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1540,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":410,"cache_read_input_tokens":163162,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1540,"cache_