deo pill (1702-1722), card text in DM Sans and DM Mono (1724-1798), list-mode overrides (1799-1866).\n  - Removed the old scattered duplicates: the card-content and list-mode block, the old pdf/quote/video rules, the old selected-state rules, and the old video scrim, play disc and poster rules.\n- `src/App.tsx`\n  - Grid constants `GRID_GAP = 12`, `TARGET_CARD_WIDTH = 286` (1293-1294).\n  - `VideoPill` (899-906) and `LibraryVideoMedia` (908-947). The no-media video branch always shows the title, with the domain when present.\n  - `cardKindClass` (965-985) and `quoteAttribution` (987-991).\n  - Card class and artwork chain (1055, 1071-1125). X posts without post data now use the typed file card instead of the \"Post preview unavailable.\" text.\n  - Card source shows reading minutes when present (1241).\n  - `storedItemToLibraryItem` reads durations, file sizes and reading minutes (445-447).\n- `src/components/ItemMedia.tsx`: shared `TypedArtwork` (88-113), `PdfArtwork`, `FileArtwork` (125-136), `formatDuration` / `formatFileSize` / `fileExtensionLabel` (138-163), `NoteArtwork` (174-187). Footnotes now render only when data exists (\"N PAGES\", \"N WORDS\").\n- `src/components/ItemMedia.test.ts`: 6 new tests for the three helpers. The file now has 11 tests, all passing.\n- `src/lib/types.ts`: optional `durationSeconds`, `fileSizeBytes`, `readingMinutes` on `LibraryItem`.\n- `src/lib/libraryApi.ts`: the same three keys typed as `unknown` on `StoredLibraryCard.metadata`.\n\n**Results**\n- `bunx biome check` on the touched frontend files: clean for my code. The one remaining hint was in search code, not mine.\n- `bun run typecheck`: exit 0 on the latest run. An earlier run failed on a bare expression in the search code, which the toolbar agent has since fixed.\n- `bun test src/components/ItemMedia.test.ts`: 11 pass.\n- Preview at 1280x800 (the tool clamped the 1440x900 request): 3 columns, 332px cards, 12px column gap, 0px border, 20px radius, note card 300px tall.\n- The adaptive column formula `round((width + 12) / 298)` stretches cards between about 249px and 323px as the window changes. Exactly 286px only occurs at a 1180px container, which is what the 1440 window with sidebar open gives.\n\n**Screenshot**\n- Not produced. `preview_snapshot` with save timed out twice, so nothing is in `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\`. Retry when the preview harness is healthy.\n- I closed the preview tab I opened. The earlier tab_3 had already disappeared on its own.\n\n**Differences from Paper and why**\n- Article with no image has no 120px strip, because there is no artwork to show. Text only.\n- Quote grows past 250px for long text and clamps at 10 lines. The brief asked to clamp only very long quotes.\n- Dropped the dark scrim over the PDF and note shader texture, so title legibility on the texture is unverified.\n- File card has no Paper artboard. It is designed in the note and PDF language.\n- Processing status and Read/Watch buttons stay hidden in grid, as before.\n- Duration, file size and reading minutes need backend metadata keys (`durationSeconds`, `fileSizeBytes`, `readingMinutes`). Until then the pill is glyph only, and no size or reading time shows.\n\n**Side effects for other areas**\n- The `.main-content` inset change also moves the toolbar and capture bar to 14px. The toolbar agent needs to confirm.\n- `NoteArtwork` and `PdfArtwork` are shared with `ExpandedItemOverlay` (`.item-stage-art`, `.note-detail-media`). Their markup and CSS changed, so the item view needs a visual check.\n- List view was reviewed in CSS only, not visually.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>133069</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>169</tool_uses><duration_ms>1296036</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>\n</system-reminder>"}]}}
