{"parentUuid":"a0eb7388-3da0-4d13-992a-5a4bf3298866","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDTpRdovRaAqVny4Q4L1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The Settings and Archive agent has finished, with the same limitation as the others. The typecheck passes, but the preview kept dropping, so nothing has been compared to Paper on screen. The agents were sharing one preview browser and closing each other's tabs. For the final comparison I'll use a single agent so that doesn't happen again.\n\nDone:\n- **Archive tiles:** captions under each tile, a Restore button and a round delete on hover, and \"Recover\" renamed to \"Restore\".\n- **Browser extension tab:** an in-app confirm replaces the browser's built-in one.\n- **Close button focus:** opening Settings no longer puts the focus ring on the close button.\n- **Library panel:** the disk size, Show folder, last copy and version slots are ready. They only appear in the desktop app.\n\nOpen questions I'll check in the cleanup round:\n- **Archive grid size:** it isn't virtualized, so every archived item renders at once. I'll check whether that was already true before this change.\n- **Paper details still not matched:** the archive's left padding, and the archive's relative dates such as \"3 days ago\".\n\nTwo agents are still running: toolbar and search, and the item view."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2282,"cache_read_input_tokens":169544,"output_tokens":429,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":49},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2282,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":429,"cache_read_input_tokens":169544,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2282,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5