{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:08:52.454Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a63e2672a50a0254f</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01B49ewBfaBcaGCSKhgNokDW</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a63e2672a50a0254f.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"W2 toolbar + search\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>The toolbar and search rework is in place and passes typecheck and Biome, but I could not run the visual check. The preview automation timed out on every snapshot and evaluate, so there is no screenshot and nothing has been compared against Paper artboards 1.1 to 1.3. The dev server answers and serves the new CSS, so the failure is in the preview channel, not the build.\n\n**Changes**\n- `src/App.tsx`\n  - Imports at ~167: `scrollViewportRect` added, `rectFrom` import removed.\n  - `captureBarRef` at 1928. Selection and history scroll math uses it at 1972, 1981, 2023 and 2038.\n  - Capture bar JSX at 5138–5288: back/forward capsule, grid/list capsule (moved out of the row below), resting or focused search pill, Add, capture error chip, and the filter row (pinned query chip, \"N results\", Save as Space).\n  - The old `library-toolbar` block and the top `LibraryEdgeFade` are removed.\n- `src/components/overlayMotion.ts` 42–51: new `scrollViewportRect` clamps the visible area to the toolbar's bottom edge.\n- `src/App.css` ~4818–5178: one commented block replaces the old search rules. The grid starts under the toolbar (`.library-scroll` margin-top -52px). The mascot rules and the focus outline match the committed originals. The black ink wipe is removed, since it turned the glass bar opaque. `mascot-bob` is defined once.\n\n**Checks**\n- `bun run typecheck`: exit 0 after the last edit.\n- `bunx biome check` on App.tsx and overlayMotion.ts: clean. I fixed my own lint and format findings along the way.\n- `bunx biome check` on App.css: format hunks at 1510, 1628, 1662, 1850 and 5612 belong to other agents' rules. None fall in my block.\n- Grep: no leftover references to `library-toolbar`, `toolbar-actions`, `search-context`, `save-space-link`, `--wipe`, `.search-field &gt; *` or `.capture-bar .add-button` in App.css.\n\n**Not verified or mismatched**\n- No screenshot was saved to `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\w2-toolbar.png`, because the file was never written.\n- The focused bar radius uses the existing `--search-radius` (20px). I have not checked it against Paper.\n- `RoamBoard.tsx:117` (dev harness, not edited) still uses the `library-toolbar` class, which now has no CSS.\n- `LibraryEdgeFade` `edge=\"top\"` is no longer used by App.tsx. The component is unchanged.\n- The `sidebarActionErrorAlert` (defined ~4760, rendered in the capture bar when the sidebar is closed) is now a flex item. I have not checked its layout.\n- The capture error chip and the filter row both sit at the top of the grid and overlap if both show.\n- Save as Space has no Paper spot. I put it in the filter row's right group.\n- The Add icon uses the default stroke, not Paper's 2.2.\n- The view selection uses a hardcoded `#ffffff14` rather than a token.\n- The main content's 48px side inset differs from Paper's 12px. That is shell layout, not in my area.\n- Preview tabs 3, 4, 5 and 7 from earlier attempts are still listed on this session. I left them open.\n\nNothing in this area needs Paper data the app lacks.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>101508</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>163</tool_uses><duration_ms>1320223</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"