{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:16:08.513Z","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a9ba195100e380a87</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>toolu_01JDRDVrcTrXN2fQuCZ524vq</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a9ba195100e380a87.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"W2 item view\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>The item view is wired up, but I could not save the required 1440x900 screenshot. The preview browser produces no animation frames, so the screenshot tool times out even on an untouched page. The Similar tab's empty state is confirmed in the DOM, and typecheck and Biome are clean.\n\n**Changes (no further edits this pass)**\n- `src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx`: tab state and similar-loading effect at 645–654 and 971–993; tabs at 1104–1113; stage toolbar at 1048; helpers `SpaceBlob`, `BarGlyph`, `PaletteSwatches`, `SimilarTile`, `SimilarColumns`, `SimilarPanel` at 414–604.\n- `src/App.css`: item-view block from about line 5098. Stage toolbar at 5248–5278. Similar tile styles at 5566–5653, empty state at 5654.\n- `src/App.tsx`: `loadSimilarLibraryItems` 4588–4605, `openSimilarItem` 4609–4618, `expandedOverlayActions` 4622–4669, overlay JSX props near 6077.\n- `src/lib/types.ts:22–23`: `palette?: string[]`.\n\n**Verified in the preview (DOM, not screenshot)**\n- Similar tab selected; \"Nothing similar yet.\" renders at x 1138, y 113, 286x20.\n- Title is 20px / 26px / 600 in Similar mode.\n- No \"Find similar\" button remains.\n- Earlier Info-state measurements: toolbar 62x34, stage image, title, note and action bar positions were recorded in the earlier pass.\n- Viewport stayed at 1280x800 even though the resize call reported 1440x900.\n\n**Does not match Paper or is unverified**\n- Screenshot not saved. The directory `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign` was created but is empty. The browser fires zero animation frames, so snapshot and frame-waiting evaluates time out. This is environmental, not my code.\n- Similar tile grid not visually checked. The web preview has no similar data.\n- GSAP flight and zoom were not re-verified this pass for the same reason. I forced reduced motion and the overlay opacity in the page to get past the stall.\n- Swatches render only when `palette` exists. Preview sample items have none, and the backend must supply it.\n- Space blob uses muted and orange colours only. Paper uses per-Space colours.\n- Paper's note-tile speckle texture is not reproduced.\n- Delete appears only for archived items and calls `deleteArchivedLibraryItem`. No trash flow exists for active items.\n- Show in folder renders only when `onShowInFolder` is passed. App does not pass it, and no existing call was found.\n- `onFindSimilar` and `findSimilarItems` are now unreachable from the overlay. They are kept because the library-wide code is out of scope. Flag for the cleanup wave.\n- A similar item that is outside the current `items` list may be treated as vanished during history stepping. Not tested.\n\n**Checks**\n- `bun run typecheck`: exit 0, no errors anywhere.\n- `bunx biome check` on `ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx` and `types.ts`: clean.\n- Biome on `App.tsx` was not rerun this pass. Earlier, the only diagnostics were in other agents' code near lines 1456 and 4285.\n\n**Preview cleanup**\n- I closed my own tabs `tab_a`, `tab_b` and `tab_c` (all created this session).\n- Earlier I closed `tab_3` and `tab_4`. They were listed under my thread, but they may have belonged to another agent.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>75853</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>191</tool_uses><duration_ms>1739726</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
