rt load once when Settings opens), no continuously repainting animations.\n\nChecks: `bun run typecheck`, `bunx biome check src/App.tsx src/App.css src/components/`, and `bun test src/components/`. Don't commit.\n\nReport: what you wired, what you removed (with rough line counts), anything still missing, and the check results."}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgDUfcEA6FWDJQLtxCUnD","requestRef":"451551b2-73b1-4fe0-a8d0-5b609470fd8e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"29cf392e-6667-4ea3-b4ca-0a9e27fd81da","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:20:24.021Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
