g is stored on disk.\n- Zoom past fit swaps in the original image for images only. The layout box is pinned to the thumbnail size and the swap waits for decode, so there is no layout flash. The pixel grid scales to original pixels.\n- `item.palette` is mapped in `storedItemToLibraryItem` (`src/App.tsx:444`) for the item view swatches.\n- `space.itemCount` feeds the sidebar counts, with a fallback when it's absent.\n- Sixth Space colour, yellow `#C9B27A`, added to `SPACE_COLORS` and the shared colour classes.\n- The orange-only detail-space dot is fixed. The item-view blob now uses the same colour classes as the sidebar dot.\n\n**Removed**\n- Library-wide Find similar mode: `findSimilarItems`, the similarity branch in the loader, the `similaritySource` memo, the similarity history commit logic, and the overlay's `onFindSimilar`/`isFindingSimilar`. `loadSimilarLibraryItems` and `openSimilarItem` stay. History still works through a ref cache (`similarItemCacheRef`) for similar items that aren't in the grid list.\n- `LibraryEdgeFade` lost its `edge=\"top\"` path (about 9 lines).\n- `RoamBoard` library-toolbar replaced with capture-bar and filter-row classes (about 7 lines).\n- Gloria Hallelujah import and Paper Mono `@font-face` removed from `App.css`. `public/fonts/paper-mono-variable.woff2` and `OFL.txt` deleted.\n- `App.css`: 33 dead rules stripped, 14 duplicate-selector groups merged where the element and specificity matched. The file went from 6118 to 5869 lines in this pass. Against HEAD, `App.css` is 133 lines added and 384 removed.\n- `App.tsx` against HEAD: 112 added and 155 removed. The Find similar removal accounts for most of the deleted lines.\n\n**Still missing or deviating**\n- `@fontsource/gloria-hallelujah` is still in `package.json` line 44. Removing it means a lockfile change, so I left it for you to decide.\n- `src/lib/pinsView.ts` still accepts `similaritySource`, and `pinsView.test.ts` line 25 asserts it. `App.tsx` no longer passes it. This is in `src/lib/`, so the backend agent should remove it.\n- `ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx:646` still shows \"Nothing similar yet.\" for the per-item similar list. That's intentional and separate from library-wide Find similar.\n- The archive grid is a plain `.map`. Base was not virtualized either, so I didn't change it.\n- `.reads-caret` in `ReadsPictures.tsx` blinks with the `memory-caret` `steps(1)` loop. It's bounded: the onboarding timeline unmounts it at `found`, and reduced motion skips straight there. Other infinite animations match base (mascot bob, three spinners, the busy spinner, and the existing memory caret). Flagging it in case the no-continuous-animation rule is read strictly.\n- `RoamBoard.tsx` keeps its hardcoded hex values. It's a dev-only board, so I left them.\n- No new tests were added for the wiring. The existing `src/components/` suite passes.\n- Visual QA and a full-app run of the wired backend calls are still pending.\n\n**Checks**\n- `bun run typecheck`: exit 0.\n- `bunx biome check --write src/App.tsx src/App.css src/components/`: reformatted 3 files (`App.tsx`, `App.css`, `ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx`), formatting only. Re-running `bunx biome check` on the same scope then reports no diagnostics, so no hand lint fixes were needed.\n- `bun test src/components/`: 92 pass, 0 fail, across 11 files.\n- CSS class audit: 428 class selectors checked, 13 flagged as unused. All 13 are intentional. Most are dynamic `is-${x}` and `flip-${phase}` variants, `is-editor-empty` is set by the editor, and `twitter-tweet-rendered` is set by the embed script. Leftover references to removed classes (`search-context`, `save-space-link`, `toolbar-actions`, `settings-archive-scroll`, `detail-space-dot`, `library-toolbar`) are gone from `src/`.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>66826</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>168</tool_uses><duration_ms>1215581</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>\n</system-reminder>"}}
