 get_computed_styles for key elements: sizes, positions, fonts, colours, radii, gaps and glass.\n\nReport per artboard: MATCHES, or a list of concrete differences (element › Paper value vs app value › severity). Put the biggest visual differences first. Note anything the preview can't show (desktop-only data). Include the screenshot paths. Close the tabs you opened."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":406,"cache_read_input_tokens":203672,"output_tokens":1055,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":98},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":406,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1055,"cache_read_input_tokens":203672,"cache_creation_input_tokens":406,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":406},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01WgDdmR2kSsSd1B6XJzK3x7":{"description":"QA: app vs Paper visual","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":true,"prompt":"READ-ONLY VISUAL QA. Don't edit source code, commit, or start or kill servers. Read C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\AGENTS.md first.\n\nThe redesign was built to match Paper: file 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page p-6-0. Load mcp__paper__get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-instructions\"}) first and always pass pageId \"p-6-0\". The branch is feat/glass-surface at HEAD 7791a0c, and the web preview is running at http://localhost:5173/. You are the ONLY agent using the preview browser now. Earlier agents failed because several shared it at once.\n\nDo this:\n1. Open the preview with the T3 preview tools (mcp__t3-code__preview_open / preview_resize to the Paper artboard size / preview_snapshot with a save path). If a snapshot times out, retry once with a fresh tab; if the tooling is still broken, say so clearly and stop.\n2. For EVERY artboard, take a matching app screenshot and the Paper screenshot (mcp__paper__get_screenshot). Save both to C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\qa-<artboard>-app.png and qa-<artboard>-paper.png. The artboards and how to reach each state:\n   - 1.1 Library;\n   - 1.2 Search drops in: click the search pill;\n   - 1.3 Query pinned: type a query, then Enter or blur;\n   - 2.1 Item inspector: open an image card;\n   - 2.2 Similar tab;\n   - 2.3 Zoomed in: zoom the image past 800%;\n   - 3.1 Settings Library;\n   - 3.2 Settings Archive: archiving one item first is fine in the preview; it's sample data;\n   - 4.1 Mascot.\n3. Compare each pair carefully, using preview_evaluate with getComputedStyle against Paper's get_computed_styles for key elements: sizes, positions, fonts, colours, radii, gaps and glass.\n\nReport per artboard: MATCHES, or a list of concrete differences (element › Paper value vs app value › severity). Put the biggest visual differences first. Note anything the preview can't show (desktop-only data). Include the screenshot paths. Close the tabs you opened."}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgDWN8GQyMxMJsbATn1e8","requestRef":"c770429c-eb68-4660-8e51-e4ccf67d18ba","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"70fa5caa-c145-400e-b419-e286690ea46c","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:42:15.604Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
