{"parentUuid":"73a21ede-1f09-4ef3-ba2a-896795e012e5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDWNxTqPnKSrPjvudGbP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The visual comparison is running: one Haiku is screenshotting every Paper screen and the matching app state, and checking sizes, fonts and colours against Paper's values.\n\nWave 3 is committed locally as `7791a0c`. Nothing is pushed yet.\n\n- **Hooked up to the backend:**\n  - the Settings footer with version, disk size and last copy;\n  - Show folder;\n  - show in folder for a single item;\n  - the original image loading once you zoom past fit;\n  - the colour swatches;\n  - item counts on every regular Space, plus the yellow Space colour;\n  - Space colours in the item view, which were stuck on orange.\n- **Removed:** the old library-wide \"Find similar\" mode, about 250 lines of CSS that nothing used anymore, the Paper Mono font, and the handwriting font.\n\nThe typecheck, lint, the unused-code check and 92 component tests pass. Smart Spaces still show no count, and video cards show the play pill without a length, for the reasons from earlier.\n\nWhen the comparison finishes, I'll split its list of differences across Haiku agents again and repeat until the app matches Paper."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1486,"cache_read_input_tokens":204078,"output_tokens":373,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1486,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":373,"cache_read_input_tokens":204078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1486,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1486},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","f