{"parentUuid":"340486da-d36a-4ff9-9e5e-cdef427631f4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgDWYABn1y9Z5gunSeBXy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Qm3w7qXYf9Gvj4v2EC1JZk","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"QA via Electron CDP","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":true,"prompt":"READ-ONLY VISUAL QA. Don't edit source code or commit. Repo: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304 (branch feat/glass-surface, HEAD 7791a0c). Read AGENTS.md first. These rules are critical:\n- no pattern kills; stop only the PIDs you spawned;\n- NEVER touch the live library;\n- the user may have the desktop app open, so leave it alone.\n\nThe T3 preview screenshot tool is broken, so DON'T use mcp__t3-code__preview_*. Instead, drive the Electron app over CDP the way the repo already does. Read .claude/skills/verify-inkling/SKILL.md (and its scripts) and scripts/ui-smoke.mjs, then use that approach:\n- build with `vite build --mode electron-preview` and launch Electron in preview mode (sample data, no backend), with an isolated --user-data-dir in a fresh temp folder;\n- set the window/viewport to 1440x900 (Electron setSize, or CDP Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride);\n- take screenshots with CDP Page.captureScreenshot.\nKeep your driver script OUTSIDE the worktree (e.g. in C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\resurf\\qa\\).\n\nCompare against the Paper redesign: file 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page p-6-0. Load mcp__paper__get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-instructions\"}) first, and always pass pageId \"p-6-0\". Get the Paper references with mcp__paper__get_screenshot. If that saves to Downloads, move the file out. The artboards:\n- 1.1 Library;\n- 1.2 Search drops in: click the search pill;\n- 1.3 Query pinned: type a query, then Enter or blur;\n- 2.1 Item inspector: open an image card;\n- 2.2 Similar tab;\n- 2.3 Zoomed in: past 800%;\n- 3.1 Settings Library;\n- 3.2 Settings Archive: archive an item first; preview data is sample-only;\n- 4.1 Mascot.\nSave pairs as C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\qa-<artboard>-app.png and -paper.png.\n\nFor key elements, compare computed styles (Runtime.evaluate getComputedStyle) against Paper's get_computed_styles: sizes, positions, font families and sizes, colours, radii, gaps and glass. Ignore pure content differences: the sample data has different items, counts and Space names than the Paper mock.\n\nReport per artboard: MATCHES, or concrete differences (element › Paper vs app › severity), biggest first. Include the screenshot paths. Stop Electron by its captured PID and remove your temp user-data dir."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1002,"cache_read_input_tokens":207309,"output_tokens":1339,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":210},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1002,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1339,"cache_read_input_tokens":207309,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1002,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1002},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Qm3w7qXYf9Gvj4v2EC1JZk":{"description":"QA via Electron CDP","model":"haiku","effort":"xhigh","run_in_background":true,"prompt":"READ-ONLY VISUAL QA. Don't edit source code or commit. Repo: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304 (branch feat/glass-surface, HEAD 7791a0c). Read AGENTS.md first. These rules are critical:\n- no pattern kills; stop only the PIDs you spawned;\n- NEVER touch the live library;\n- the user may have the desktop app open, so leave it alone.\n\nThe T3 preview screenshot tool is broken, so DON'T use mcp__t3-code__preview_*. Instead, drive the Electron app over CDP the way the repo already does. Read .claude/skills/verify-inkling/SKILL.md (and its scripts) and scripts/ui-smoke.mjs, then use that approach:\n- build with `vite build --mode electron-preview` and launch Electron in preview mode (sample data, no backend), with an isolated --user-data-dir in a fresh temp folder;\n- set the window/viewport to 1440x900 (Electron setSize, or CDP Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride);\n- take screenshots with CDP Page.captureScreenshot.\nKeep your driver script OUTSIDE the worktree (e.g. in C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\resurf\\qa\\).\n\nCompare against the Paper redesign: file 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page p-6-0. Load mcp__paper__get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-instructions\"}) first, and always pass pageId \"p-6-0\". Get the Paper references with mcp__paper__get_screenshot. If that saves to Downloads, move the file out. The artboards:\n- 1.1 Library;\n- 1.2 Search drops in: click the search pill;\n- 1.3 Query pinned: type a query, then Enter or blur;\n- 2.1 Item inspector: open an image card;\n- 2.2 Similar tab;\n- 2.3 Zoomed in: past 800%;\n- 3.1 Settings Library;\n- 3.2 Settings Archive: archive an item first; preview data is sample-only;\n- 4.1 Mascot.\nSave pairs as C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\qa-<artboard>-app.png and -paper.png.\n\nFor key elements, compare computed styles (Runtime.evaluate getComputedStyle) against Paper's get_computed_styles: sizes, positions, font families and sizes, colours, radii, gaps and glass. Ignore pure content differences: the sample data has different items, counts and Space names than the Paper mock.\n\nReport per artboard: MATCHES, or concrete differences (element › Paper vs app › severity), biggest first. Include the screenshot paths. Stop Electron by its captured PID and remove your temp user-data dir."}},"apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgDWY9myq5Z9CMTJfyhna","requestRef":"4bd13150-a409-47f5-b769-469f49367790","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"d30f4dfa-3976-4659-99ee-fe245095208e","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:44:34.061Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
