{"parentUuid":"d30f4dfa-3976-4659-99ee-fe245095208e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"75e12b1a-1722-4879-8387-8628e4fa2884","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Qm3w7qXYf9Gvj4v2EC1JZk","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Async agent launched successfully. (This tool result is internal metadata — never quote or paste any part of it, including the agentId below, into a user-facing reply.)\nagentId: a4fd0ebb47aa00594 (internal ID - do not mention to user. Use SendMessage with to: 'a4fd0ebb47aa00594', summary: '<5-10 word recap>' to continue this agent.)\nThe agent is working in the background. You will be notified automatically when it completes. You know nothing about its results until that notification arrives — do not report, assume, or predict them; continue other work or respond to the user in the meantime.\nDo not duplicate this agent's work — avoid working with the same files or topics it is using.\noutput_file: C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a4fd0ebb47aa00594.output\nDo NOT Read or tail this file via the shell tool — it is the full subagent JSONL transcript and reading it will overflow your context. If the user asks for progress, say the agent is still running; you'll get a completion notification."}]}]},"uuid":"59162f44-6c1f-4acd-aae1-208f8333ff16","timestamp":"2026-10-20T12:44:34.805Z","toolUseResult":{"isAsync":true,"status":"async_launched","agentId":"a4fd0ebb47aa00594","description":"QA via Electron CDP","resolvedModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","prompt":"READ-ONLY VISUAL QA. Don't edit source code or commit. Repo: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304 (branch feat/glass-surface, HEAD 7791a0c). Read AGENTS.md first. These rules are critical:\n- no pattern kills; stop only the PIDs you spawned;\n- NEVER touch the live library;\n- the user may have the desktop app open, so leave it alone.\n\nThe T3 preview screenshot tool is broken, so DON'T use mcp__t3-code__preview_*. Instead, drive the Electron app over CDP the way the repo already does. Read .claude/skills/verify-inkling/SKILL.md (and its scripts) and scripts/ui-smoke.mjs, then use that approach:\n- build with `vite build --mode electron-preview` and launch Electron in preview mode (sample data, no backend), with an isolated --user-data-dir in a fresh temp folder;\n- set the window/viewport to 1440x900 (Electron setSize, or CDP Emulation.setDeviceMetricsOverride);\n- take screenshots with CDP Page.captureScreenshot.\nKeep your driver script OUTSIDE the worktree (e.g. in C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\resurf\\qa\\).\n\nCompare against the Paper redesign: file 01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW, page p-6-0. Load mcp__paper__get_guide({topic:\"paper-mcp-instructions\"}) first, and always pass pageId \"p-6-0\". Get the Paper references with mcp__paper__get_screenshot. If that saves to Downloads, move the file out. The artboards:\n- 1.1 Library;\n- 1.2 Search drops in: click the search pill;\n- 1.3 Query pinned: type a query, then Enter or blur;\n- 2.1 Item inspector: open an image card;\n- 2.2 Similar tab;\n- 2.3 Zoomed in: past 800%;\n- 3.1 Settings Library;\n- 3.2 Settings Archive: archive an item first; preview data is sample-only;\n- 4.1 Mascot.\nSave pairs as C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\resurf-redesign\\qa-<artboard>-app.png and -paper.png.\n\nFor key elements, compare computed styles (Runtime.evaluate getComputedStyle) against Paper's get_computed_styles: sizes, positions, font families and sizes, colours, radii, gaps and glass. Ignore pure content differences: the sample data has different items, counts and Space names than the Paper mock.\n\nReport per artboard: MATCHES, or concrete differences (element › Paper vs app › severity), biggest first. Include the screenshot paths. Stop Electron by its captured PID and remove your temp user-data dir.","outputFile":"C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a4fd0ebb47aa00594.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d30f4dfa-3976-4659-99ee-fe245095208e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
