scot busy and capture-failed states cannot be triggered.\n\n### Cleanup\n\n- Stopped PID 40876 (electron.exe, preview, CDP 53602, profile `inkling-resurf-qa-TtTTN2`) after confirming its command line. Also stopped its three child processes (41884, 36320, 7584), found through the parent chain. Confirmed gone.\n- Deleted the temp profile and `run.json`.\n- Restored `HKCU\\Software\\Classes\\inkling` from the pre-launch backup. The dev launch had repointed it to this worktree's Electron. Heads-up: launching the dev Electron repoints the `inkling://` handler, so a deep-link test will need the same restore.\n- No source edits, no commits. `git status` is clean. The worktree `dist\\` was overwritten by the `vite build --mode electron-preview` run and is gitignored.\n- Never touched the desktop app or the live library.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>188400</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>104</tool_uses><duration_ms>1204325</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>\n</system-reminder>"}]}}
