{"parentUuid":"f7768fb6-c535-43b9-89ac-69c81fd1a25c","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"mcp_instructions_delta","addedNames":["claude.ai Linear","claude.ai Unsplash"],"addedBlocks":["## claude.ai Linear\nWhen passing string values to tools, send the content directly without escape sequences. For example, use real newlines in markdown content rather than literal backslash-n (\\n) characters.","## claude.ai Unsplash\nUse this server when a task would benefit from existing visual assets, even if the user does not explicitly mention Unsplash, stock photos, or image search. It is appropriate for presentations, slide decks, documents, websites, social posts, marketing graphics, mood boards, art direction, hero images, thumbnails, UI mockups, and visual inspiration. Do not use it to generate new images, edit images, create logos, icons, diagrams, charts, or retrieve private or personal images."],"removedNames":[]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"3606e4bf-d6d6-4ad0-a34b-3c973df45e29","timestamp":"2026-10-20T20:30:17.281Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\n# MCP Server Instructions\n\nThe following MCP servers have provided instructions for how to use their tools and resources:\n\n## claude.ai Linear\nWhen passing string values to tools, send the content directly without escape sequences. For example, use real newlines in markdown content rather than literal backslash-n (\\n) characters.\n\n## claude.ai Unsplash\nUse this server when a task would benefit from existing visual assets, even if the user does not explicitly mention Unsplash, stock photos, or image search. It is appropriate for presentations, slide decks, documents, websites, social posts, marketing graphics, mood boards, art direction, hero images, thumbnails, UI mockups, and visual inspiration. Do not use it to generate new images, edit images, create logos, icons, diagrams, charts, or retrieve private or personal images.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoin