capture, video posters, electron/), say so instead of fixing them.\n\nREPORT (under 150 words): what changed, when the archive loads now, how virtualization works, whether processing summaries are still fetched, checks run with results, and anything left unfinished.","outputFile":"C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\claude\\C--Users-chris--t3-worktrees-inkling-t3-47ff5304\\fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7\\tasks\\a0034157f14c1d64c.output","canReadOutputFile":true,"canContinueAgent":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"60309d58-1314-495e-b70c-b61265ac5569","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
