{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"97893014e1e1413729f35a9742452f003a01ee723c1638e5dc0b8b95fbb64c8c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Without `stream: true`, Chromium's media element can't issue range requests or seek properly on custom protocol responses—Electron requires that flag for video/audio streaming. I'll add it with a targeted edit to main.mjs.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014hr8RTdp2wkzCT1LLSzJZx","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\perf-library-io\\electron\\main.mjs","old_string":"    privileges: { standard: true, secure: true, supportFetchAPI: true, corsEnabled: false },","new_string":"    // stream lets <video> and <audio> issue Range requests against the asset handler.\n    privileges: {\n      standard: true,\n      secure: true,\n      supportFetchAPI: true,\n      corsEnabled: false,\n      stream: true,\n    },"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
