{"parentUuid":"ea442932-c975-4ed0-939d-c051cd28fbbe","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEDhWPUk9KNi2drLuGDs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The video poster agent is done:\n- **When posters are made:** capture now queues a poster job without waiting on it. Existing local videos get backfilled one at a time while the app is idle.\n- **How:** the job uses the Windows shell thumbnailer through Electron, with no new dependency, and saves the result as the card thumbnail.\n- **Grid:** cards no longer load the video file, and cards without a poster show the video artwork instead of the empty dark tile.\n\nThe catch is the card height: a video card is 300px tall until its poster lands, then shrinks to 190px. That's a visible reflow, which I'll look at during the integration pass.\n\nTwelve existing tests in `ai-jobs.test.ts` and `storage.test.ts` are currently failing:\n- **Eleven** fail because the still-running capture change no longer accepts the old number-array bytes; those tests need updating to match.\n- **One** is a Windows path-separator assertion in `storage.test.ts`.\n\nI'll check both once the capture agent finishes, which is the last one still running."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2227,"cache_read_input_tokens":84342,"output_tokens":643,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":304},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2227,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":643,"cache_read_input_tokens":84342,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2227,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2227},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgEDhW68TvxvfSssrgSev","requestRef":"c56016b9-5c51-4b68-b866-fef03380666d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"199fcbfd-c49b-4cda-a1a6-240d71df2b55","timestamp":"2026-10-20T21:44:16.190Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
