job queue.\n+- Image captures appear immediately: files travel to the backend as binary data instead of a number array, and the thumbnail is made by a background job that survives restarts instead of blocking the save.\n - The app no longer contacts Google Fonts or Twitter/X at startup: reader fonts are bundled with the app and the content security policy no longer allows Google Fonts requests\n - X post embeds load the X widget only when the user clicks to load the post, so cards and saved links no longer contact X or Twitter on open\n - The library bottom fade no longer shows a hard edge where the blur band starts or where it meets the padding below the grid: one blur layer feathers out through an eased mask, and a canvas-colored scrim dissolves content into the background at the grid's clip line (#149)\nShell cwd was reset to C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"fd54324a-1d21-4581-b9e3-cff6dc411c85","timestamp":"2026-10-20T21:47:19.013Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":" M docs/changelog.md\n M electron/ai-jobs.mjs\n M electron/ai-jobs.test.ts\n M electron/main.mjs\n M electron/storage.mjs\n M electron/storage.test.ts\n M electron/thumbnail.mjs\n M electron/thumbnail.test.ts\n M src/App.css\n M src/App.tsx\n M src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx\n M src/components/ItemMedia.tsx\n M src/lib/libraryApi.ts\n?? electron/asset-response.mjs\n?? electron/asset-response.test.ts\n?? electron/video-poster.mjs\n?? electron/video-poster.test.ts\n?? src/components/ArchiveGrid.tsx\n?? src/components/archiveGridWindow.test.ts\n?? src/components/archiveGridWindow.ts\n docs/changelog.md                      |   1 +\n electron/ai-jobs.mjs                   |  45 +++++++-\n electron/ai-jobs.test.ts               | 185 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--\n electron/main.mjs                      |  65 ++++++------\n electron/storage.mjs                   | 110 +++++++++++++++-----\n electron/storage.test.ts               | 104 +++++++++++++++