{"parentUuid":"bbb0afdd-e523-4c0d-8a56-289fc339796a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEE7jKmnsqbQ4FSMRYwz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should wrap up with a concise final report covering what changed (moved the poster job, restored the original fallback, added stream privilege), the test results, the fact that nothing was run in the real app yet, and the remaining next step of a UI pass with screenshots—noting the optional items like incremental refresh and job-status batching haven't been started.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":176,"cache_read_input_tokens":110581,"output_tokens":829,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":87},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":176,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":829,"cache_read_input_tokens":110581,"cache_creation_input_tokens":176,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":176},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6869,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEE7j3A1k3bS2XehSNF2","requestRef":"257d874a-97b1-4137-ad70-842adc2399b2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"link_pull_request","type":"assistant","uuid":"a1afe3c4-04d0-417d-a0fb-607afa3bd8c2","timestamp":"2026-10-20T21:49:45.087Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"a1afe3c4-04d0-417d-a0fb-607afa3bd8c2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEE7jKmnsqbQ4FSMRYwz","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The four performance fixes are done, committed and pushed. They're in draft PR [#174](https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/174), which is stacked on #170 and linked to this thread. None of it has been run in the real app yet: no screenshots, and no test against a real video file.\n\n**What changed:**\n- **Capture:** file bytes go to the backend as binary data instead of a number array, so they're much smaller over IPC. The card appears as soon as the file is saved; the thumbnail is made in the background and picks up again after a restart.\n- **Video posters:** a background job makes a poster image for each local video, using Windows' own thumbnailer (no new dependency). Existing videos get one gradually while the app is idle. Cards no longer load the video file, and a video without a poster shows the video artwork instead of the empty dark tile.\n- **Assets:** library files are streamed instead of read whole into memory, and requests for part of a file work. Large videos and PDFs should start sooner, and videos can seek.\n- **Archive tab:** it reads the archive only when you open the tab, and only draws the cards near the scroll position.\n- **Settings size** (pushed to #170): the last measured library size shows straight away and refreshes in the background.\n\n**What I changed in the agents' work:**\n- Image cards show the original until the thumbnail is ready, as they did before. The agent had them show a placeholder, which would have stuck forever on any image whose thumbnail fails, and on older images that never had one.\n- I put video posters on the same worker as image thumbnails, so neither waits behind OCR.\n- I enabled streaming for the app's internal file scheme. Without it, videos couldn't seek even with the range support.\n\n**Checks:** 86 of 87 tests pass across the touched files. The one failure is a Windows path-separator test that, per its agent, already failed on `main`. Typecheck and Biome are clean.\n\n**Side effects you'll notice:**\n- A video card is taller until its poster arrives, then shrinks once.\n- The number next to \"Archive\" in Settings only shows after you've opened that tab.\n\n**Next:**\n- One run in the real app, with before/after screenshots for #174.\n- The two optional items, faster library refresh and batched job-status lookups, haven't been started."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":176,"cache_read_input_tokens":110581,"output_tokens":829,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":87},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":176,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":829,"cache_read_input_tokens":110581,"cache_creation_input_tokens":176,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":176},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgEE7j3A1k3bS2XehSNF2","requestRef":"257d874a-97b1-4137-ad70-842adc2399b2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"link_pull_request","type":"assistant","uuid":"2298770f-0b12-4e9c-8da1-91a641f5acfa","timestamp":"2026-10-20T21:49:46.082Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"xhigh","perTurnEffort":"xhigh","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
