cal\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e\\. Create the folder if missing, and only wipe that subfolder. Clean up every process you launched and restore the registry key.\n\nREPORT (concise): a pass/fail per item above with evidence (screenshot paths, log lines, timings), each bug found with exact repro and suspected file, and anything you could not test and why."}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgEEixzn8DywEtKA126rV","requestRef":"4dabe7ac-7f08-4087-abe0-0b24327a4ebe","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"orchestrator_capabilities","type":"assistant","uuid":"609f3ca1-69cd-4fd9-a6b4-210f7590aa55","timestamp":"2026-10-20T21:57:52.007Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
