{"parentUuid":"9d0c298d-1443-4537-bec2-53541887a68f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEGd9tSK5Zr22bCSUEZZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm wondering if this startup crash predates my change — checking whether ocr.mjs is imported statically in ai-jobs.mjs, since there's a lazy-loading test suggesting that's intentional. It might be the tesseract worker loading regenerator-runtime that's triggering the failure.\n\nThe uncaught exception seems to come from the worker thread script requiring regenerator-runtime, which makes me suspect electron-builder isn't properly collecting transitive dependencies from bun's isolated node_modules layout when packaging. I should check whether regenerator-runtime actually exists in the unpacked app.asar.unpacked/node_modules directory.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1190,"cache_read_input_tokens":129807,"output_tokens":574,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":386},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1190,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":574,"cache_read_input_tokens":129807,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1190,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1190},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":5986,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEGd9XqyHznd2LYk1Sxq","requestRef":"ec917c47-f898-41c7-b1ee-1884994e74aa","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0d8ab0ac-18f6-4d69-ba76-2c9c5abe9d1d","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:22:35.832Z","advisorModel":"claud