{"parentUuid":"1031012c-9543-474f-ba75-17d47b007ef6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEGpdxx1HQA22n6xTMcW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm wondering whether to notify Luna about the crash fix, but using t3_thread_send on the child thread isn't allowed for continuing a delegated review in this test task. Without another channel, I'll let the run continue and plan to rerun if Luna reports the crash — though I'm still torn about whether informing it mid-run would actually be better.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":569,"cache_read_input_tokens":153451,"output_tokens":762,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":158},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":569,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":762,"cache_read_input_tokens":153451,"cache_creation_input_tokens":569,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":569},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7557,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEGpdfaZdnRveLq6WXp1","requestRef":"35c95083-b030-471a-a161-78e2d94a2c7f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"11bc77bd-6b92-4a6e-9854-2ef56971600f","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:25:13.167Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"11bc77bd-6b92-4a6e-9854-2ef56971600f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEGpdxx1HQA22n6xTMcW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the crash Luna hit and set the window to 1280×720, and the simpler job-status change is in. The incremental refresh is still being written.\n\n**The crash.** OCR runs in a worker that the installed app keeps outside its main bundle (`app.asar`), but the worker's own dependencies, `regenerator-runtime` among them, were packed inside it, where the worker can't reach them. So the installed app crashed as soon as OCR started. The fix is to add those dependencies to `asarUnpack` in `package.json`. This was already wrong before the redesign, so I committed it to `feat/glass-surface` (#170) and merged that into the perf branch. It will only show up in a fresh `bun run build:dir`; the build Luna is testing predates it.\n\n**Window size.** The app now opens at 1280×720 in both dev and the installed app. The minimum size is unchanged.\n\n**Job-status lookup.** I took your \"if there's a better way, do it\" and replaced the chunking idea with one query:\n- All the item ids go in as a single parameter, so a large library can no longer exceed SQLite's limit.\n- SQL returns only the latest job of each kind instead of every job the item ever had.\n\nA new test checks this with 40,000 ids. The storage and job tests pass, apart from the Windows path-separator test that, per its agent, already failed on `main`. It's committed and pushed to #174.\n\n**Incremental refresh.** A Sonnet agent is working on it in the perf worktree. When a job finishes or a thumbnail lands, it should update only the cards that changed instead of reloading the whole library. It has to keep the existing protection against a refresh overwriting your unsaved note edits and pins.\n\nLuna's end-to-end test is still running, against the build that crashes. Once it reports and the refresh change is in, I'll rebuild and have it re-test."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":569,"cache_read_input_tokens":153451,"output_tokens":762,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":158},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":569,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":762,"cache_read_input_tokens":153451,"cache_creation_input_tokens":569,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":569},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgEGpdfaZdnRveLq6WXp1","requestRef":"35c95083-b030-471a-a161-78e2d94a2c7f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3d778b52-7eea-48c2-a46d-0ef9a6b0933b","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:25:13.215Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
