{"parentUuid":"414a7560-c858-4447-b2eb-b83df6d298d7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEGuwGsxcGPBF33dDDRW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Luna's end-to-end test passed all six areas in the installed (unpacked) build:\n\n| Area | Result |\n|---|---|\n| Image capture | The original shows straight away, and the thumbnail replaces it about 1 second after saving. |\n| Local video | The video artwork shows first and the poster replaces it. The card goes from 300px to 190px tall when the poster lands. There's no video element in the grid, and the video plays and seeks in the detail view. |\n| Asset streaming | A 64 MiB file streams. Partial requests get 206, out-of-range requests get 416, and a path-escape attempt gets 404. |\n| Archive | With 120 archived items only 18 cards are drawn at a time. Restore, delete and the empty state work. The tab count appears only after you open the tab. |\n| Settings size | The size shows immediately. |\n| Redesign smoke test | Search, pinning, the Info and Similar tabs, zoom, back and forward, and every Settings tab work. There were no console errors. |\n\nScreenshots are in `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e\\`:\n\n![Image displayed before thumbnail](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e\\image-original-first.png)\n\n![Video card before poster](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e\\video-pending.png)\n\n![Archive with 120 items](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e\\archive-top-120.png)\n\nIts report has some gaps:\n- **The OCR crash isn't in it.** That's the crash you saw while it was testing, so its \"no errors\" covers only the page itself. That crash is fixed in the commit I pushed last turn, but the build it tested is older than that fix.\n- **Not covered:** recovery after an interrupted thumbnail job, and the real Windows file picker, clipboard and drag gestures. It simulated those instead.\n- **An update-check error** (`app-update.yml` missing) is logged in folder builds made with `build:dir`. Those builds don't create that file, so it's unrelated to these changes and harmless.\n\nThe Sonnet agent on the incremental library refresh is still running. When it finishes I'll review it, rebuild with the OCR fix, and have Luna re-test the installed app."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2193,"cache_read_input_tokens":154020,"output_tokens":885,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":82},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2193,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":885,"cache_read_input_tokens":154020,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2193,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2193},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgEGuvxHTMkL7keD3mwzE","requestRef":"4f8465d1-1bfa-4c83-baec-e725b7bfa186","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"50b22114-5e50-4dcb-981c-d4e8df3b278b","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:26:25.474Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
