ack to a full reload for a query or Space view, an id-less event, an active item not yet in the list, a full load already in flight, or any error.\n\n**Session-state guarantees**\n- The note body cache, unconfirmed pins and selected-item sync moved into helpers shared by both paths. They are read at apply time, not fetch time.\n- An epoch counter drops a patch that a newer full load has overtaken.\n\n**Risks**\n- A patched item keeps its grid position, whereas a full reload moved it to the top (the backend orders by `updated_at DESC`).\n- The 30s visible-tab fallback still does a full reload.\n- I added no changelog entry.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>80980</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>19</tool_uses><duration_ms>147268</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
