{"parentUuid":"8e931425-e8e5-470f-8ae4-5b319107bf91","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEH4Kf11rX69vwBk2p2i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The incremental library refresh is done and pushed to #174, so both optional items are now in. Its new tests pass and typecheck is clean. It hasn't been run in the app yet; that's part of the Luna re-test below.\n\n**How it works now:**\n- In the main library view, when background work finishes, only the cards it touched are fetched and swapped in. The other cards stay as they are, so they don't re-render.\n- Job updates that arrive close together are grouped into one update.\n- A full reload still happens on first load, in search and Space views (where a finished job can change which items belong), when a new item appears, and on any error. The existing protection for unsaved note edits and pins still applies to these partial updates.\n\n**Things you might notice:**\n- An updated card stays where it is in the grid. Before, a full reload could move it to the top.\n- The existing 30-second background refresh of a visible library still does a full reload.\n\n**Fix to the agent's work:** it had converted several files to Windows line endings, so I switched them back. With that, Biome is clean.\n\nLuna has started round 2 on a fresh installed build that includes the OCR fix. It's checking:\n1. OCR works with no error dialog, and text from an image becomes searchable.\n2. The incremental refresh: the right card updates, other cards don't move, and archiving or deleting mid-job behaves.\n3. Failed and retried jobs show the right status.\n4. The window opens at 1280×720.\n5. Thumbnails finish after a restart if one was interrupted.\n6. A quick regression pass over round 1.\n\nI've asked it to take full-screen screenshots so a native error dialog can't be missed again. I'll pass on its results when it reports."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1972,"cache_read_input_tokens":165311,"output_tokens":539,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1972,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":539,"cache_read_input_tokens":165311,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1972,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1972},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEH4KDx9tMV75HJdQVmE","requestRef":"ba1bb3b0-d5bf-437b-a61e-724dadfddee6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"delegate_task","type":"assistant","uuid":"9ce9f08b-6505-4c2b-a6d3-62444a41d7ec","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:28:16.507Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
