{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":174,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/174","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:41:35.670Z"}
{"parentUuid":"e1339499-edd5-4898-a3af-a273b606f25a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEJ5cRhhSC7KdZ7vmVHx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed it, and it's pushed to #174. It wasn't serious: one full reload every 30 seconds, plus one each time you switched back to the window, even when nothing had changed. In a big library that's wasted work, though.\n\n**What it does now:** the safety refresh and the refresh when you come back to the window still run, but they ask the database first whether anything has been written since the last full load. That uses SQLite's built-in `total_changes()` counter. Only if the number has moved does it do the full reload, so an idle library is never re-read.\n\n**What it keeps:** the safety net for missed updates still works. Any write moves the counter, even one whose update event got lost, and the next check reloads.\n\n**Limits:**\n- While background jobs are running, the counter keeps moving, so you still get a full reload every 30 seconds then, the same as before. Once the work settles there's one final reload, and after that none until something changes.\n- The counter only counts writes made by the main process. That's fine today because nothing else writes to the database.\n\n**Checks:** a new test confirms the counter stays the same on reads and moves on writes, and typecheck and Biome are clean. It hasn't been run in the real app. Luna's round 3 is testing the build from before this change, so this part will need its own check."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":647,"cache_read_input_tokens":181431,"output_tokens":402,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":647,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":402,"cache_read_input_tokens":181431,"cache_creation_input_tokens":647,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":647},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEJ5bzQqqEB7YytGvCCE","requestRef":"492c3dd6-de01-41a0-96bb-afee6dfabd32","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5eb874de-e148-4e01-9c6d-643dbf977f22","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:41:39.775Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
