{"parentUuid":"4b42ee88-ba5c-439f-a320-1d1f0f3581af","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a85b8ddd-99aa-4791-bf78-fcacf4f56187","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Delegated task node:delegated-task:command%3Amcp%3A2dd0b88d-eaff-4e1a-b29c-2ffb930c8d61%3Adelegate-task%3Aperf-e2e-luna-3 (E2E retest round 3 (CDP)) [completed]:\n## Round 3 results\n\n| Check | Result | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| OCR and search | **Pass, with warnings.** The captured image appeared for a search for `quasar meadow`. No native window titled “Error,” `Uncaught Exception`, or `Cannot find module` appeared. | Tesseract logged repeated “Image too small to scale” warnings. Both launches also logged a separate updater error because `resources/app-update.yml` was missing. |\n| Incremental refresh | **Fail.** After saving a unique PNG, a marked card’s existing DOM node became detached, and mounted cards changed order. | Repro: mark a visible card, then Add → File → select a unique PNG → Save to library. After about 800 ms, the item remained in the grid, but the marked card node was disconnected. Suspected area: [App.tsx](C:/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/perf-library-io/src/App.tsx). |\n| Failed and retried job status | **Not tested.** I didn’t force a job failure. |\n| Default window size | **Pass, with a measurement caveat.** The fresh window launched at the configured 1280×720 size; `window.outerWidth/outerHeight` reported 1296×728, including window chrome. |\n| Thumbnail restart check | **Partial.** All four cards and thumbnails loaded from the same scratch library after relaunch. Their thumbnail jobs had already finished before close, so this did not test recovery of interrupted jobs. |\n| Quick regressions | **Partial.** Archive and Settings opened; the Archive tab showed the archived item. Video poster and seeking were not tested because the library had no video item. |\n\nI didn’t verify job completion while a search query was active, archiving or deleting during active jobs, or the active-job/mascot idle indicator. The OCR search was run after its job completed, and the image jobs finished quickly.\n\nThe missing `app-update.yml` error reproduced at launch and is separate from OCR. Suspected area: [updater.mjs](C:/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/perf-library-io/electron/updater.mjs) or the packaging configuration.\n\nScreenshots are saved in `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e-3\\`. The app processes I launched were stopped, the registry backup was imported, and I made no source edits or git state changes.\n\n![App after restart](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e-3\\after-restart.png)"},"uuid":"830574c7-4754-4a14-af77-f56e76d16b8c","timestamp":"2026-10-20T22:43:07.360Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":129},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
