R or a failed job from the inspector, or call the retry command.\n   - When the job finishes, confirm the marked nodes are still connected and in the same order, and that the target card's state updated.\n2. Job completion while a search query is active still refreshes the results.\n3. Archive, then delete, an item while its jobs are still running. It disappears cleanly with no ghost card and no console errors.\n4. The active job count/mascot settles to idle after work finishes.\n5. Failed-then-retried job status shows correctly on the card and in the inspector. Use the corrupt file.\n6. Idle refresh skip. With the library idle and visible, record the getItemCards / list IPC traffic or count renders across 60+ seconds and one window blur/focus. The full reload should NOT run when nothing changed, and should run once after a change.\n7. Video: the poster lands, there is no <video> element in the grid, and the detail view plays and seeks.\n8. The updater: confirm no `app-update.yml` ENOENT error is logged at launch now.\n\nSave screenshots to C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e-4\\ (create it if missing). Clean up all processes you launched and restore the registry key.\n\nREPORT (concise):\n- pass/fail per item with evidence;\n- each bug with exact repro and suspected file;\n- what you couldn't test and why."}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEN2iFKpcHNrXQjGR3dB","requestRef":"049f1f4a-6cdb-4f1e-a955-9bc196e5e01b","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8d0d8f00-f0fa-46d6-a2ee-506b63d802d8","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:33:34.792Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
