{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":174,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/174","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:33:35.076Z"}
{"parentUuid":"dbb4f348-6d8e-498c-84e1-8e2f11402eaf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEN3c4HqJijsW9jHt1CD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the `app-update.yml` error and pushed it to #174. Builds made with `build:dir` don't include the file that tells the updater where to look, so the app now skips the update check when that file is missing. Installer builds include it, so their update checks work as before. Biome is clean, and Luna will confirm the error is gone at launch.\n\nLuna's round 4 has started on a fresh build. It's checking only what's still unverified:\n- **Incremental refresh:** a job finishing on an existing item, with no new capture, should leave the other cards in place.\n- **Search:** a job finishing during a search still refreshes the results.\n- **Archive or delete mid-job:** the card disappears cleanly.\n- **Mascot:** it settles back to idle when work finishes.\n- **Failed then retried job:** the status shows correctly on the card and in the item view.\n- **Idle refresh:** the 30-second refresh skips the reload when nothing has changed.\n- **Video:** the poster appears, the grid doesn't load the video, and playback and seeking work.\n- **Updater:** no `app-update.yml` error at launch.\n\nI'll report back when it finishes."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1855,"cache_read_input_tokens":189204,"output_tokens":374,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1855,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":374,"cache_read_input_tokens":189204,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1855,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1855},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEN3bjwfbQAKVh5VtWgV","requestRef":"dfb70e89-3d1c-4843-9cd4-5e8f50704531","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"delegate_task","type":"assistant","uuid":"2b31c479-0e57-4679-b9c6-1e8d14a766a8","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:33:38.854Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
