 Repro: capture a JPEG with a valid header and truncated/corrupted image data, then let OCR process it. Suspect the Tesseract worker error boundary in [ocr.mjs](C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\perf-library-io\\electron\\ocr.mjs), called by [ai-jobs.mjs](C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\perf-library-io\\electron\\ai-jobs.mjs).\n\nThe generated text image’s OCR job completed with empty text, so the search-refresh check used a unique sentinel in the **scratch** OCR field, then verified that re-OCR removed the result. The failed-job card and inspector retry flow remains unverified because the native error dialog interrupted the app. Actual native window blur/focus also remains unverified; only synthetic events were available under the CDP-only constraint."},"uuid":"20ea1ca5-d254-42f3-8e6c-90e0f592018d","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:58:09.422Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":131},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
