{"parentUuid":"79bfb975-5cd4-4b16-ae89-61943d110bbf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEPvwdoRpv9eXgFVFJa6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking the default sort order, likely updated_at DESC, which means an OCR completion bumping updated_at would reorder items to the top on reload. That looks like pre-existing ordering behavior triggered by the retry handler's reload, not a bug introduced by the patch—so maybe the grid should sort by created_at instead for consistency.\n\nSeparately, the tesseract.js worker error for a bad image is likely thrown as an uncaught exception in the main thread rather than caught cleanly. The fix is to normalize the image with sharp into a PNG before running OCR, so corrupt images fail gracefully instead of crashing the worker—I need to check the OCR job processor to confirm this.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":954,"cache_read_input_tokens":194389,"output_tokens":626,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":396},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":954,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":626,"cache_read_input_tokens":194389,"cache_creation_input_tokens":954,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":954},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6344,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEPvwNBXdT7TiSA7zubz","requestRef":"1060ea7f-202e-4ffb-aecd-e12753e5fef1","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"4e2eee6b-ee6b-4366-a4b4-745fb038b802","timestamp":"2026