{"parentUuid":"1f395a86-c4f7-428e-9978-9c5d44b1b9d1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEQ2wJsoaZitJWUaaTcy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RafMisZLboxRuohE1UJVKL","name":"mcp__t3-code__delegate_task","input":{"title":"E2E retest round 5","role":"test","clientRequestId":"perf-e2e-luna-5","mode":"async","target":{"providerInstanceId":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","options":{"reasoningEffort":"high"}},"task":"Round 5 end-to-end test of the inkling Windows desktop app. This is TEST ONLY: edit no source and run no git commands that change state.\n\nWORKSPACE: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\perf-library-io (branch perf/library-io, PR #174). Use the same setup as your round 4:\n- a scratch library;\n- CDP via `--remote-debugging-port=0`;\n- reg export/import of HKCU\\Software\\Classes\\inkling;\n- kill only PIDs you spawned;\n- log stdout/stderr and take PowerShell screenshots to catch native dialogs.\nReuse your round 4 scripts under C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\. Rebuild first with `bun run build:dir`.\n\nROUND 4 FOUND TWO BUGS, NOW FIXED:\n(a) After an existing image's OCR finished, the card moved to the top and the marked card nodes were disconnected. Cause: storing OCR text bumped updated_at, which the list sorts by. OCR no longer touches updated_at.\n(b) A corrupt JPEG opened a native \"Error attempting to read image\" main-process dialog during OCR. Images are now decoded with sharp before tesseract, so the job should just fail.\n\nVERIFY:\n1. Repeat round 4 check 1 exactly. With the list settled, mark several visible card nodes, then reprocess OCR on an EXISTING image without capturing anything. Once it finishes:\n   - the marked nodes stay connected;\n   - the order is unchanged;\n   - the target card's state is updated.\n2. Capture the corrupt JPEG again:\n   - no native error dialog appears (check full-screen screenshots and the logs);\n   - its jobs fail cleanly;\n   - then check the failed-then-retried status on the card and in the inspector (retry from the UI). The item should keep a sensible card throughout.\n3. Quick sanity: OCR on a good text image still makes it searchable, and video poster and Archive still work.\n\nSave screenshots to C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e-5\\. Clean up all processes and restore the registry key.\n\nREPORT (concise):\n- pass/fail per item with evidence;\n- any bug with repro and suspected file;\n- what was untested and why."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1090,"cache_read_input_tokens":202483,"output_tokens":1162,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":147},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1090,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1162,"cache_read_input_tokens":202483,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1090,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1090},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01RafMisZLboxRuohE1UJVKL":{"title":"E2E retest round 5","role":"test","clientRequestId":"perf-e2e-luna-5","mode":"async","target":{"providerInstanceId":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","options":{"reasoningEffort":"high"}},"task":"Round 5 end-to-end test of the inkling Windows desktop app. This is TEST ONLY: edit no source and run no git commands that change state.\n\nWORKSPACE: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\perf-library-io (branch perf/library-io, PR #174). Use the same setup as your round 4:\n- a scratch library;\n- CDP via `--remote-debugging-port=0`;\n- reg export/import of HKCU\