{"parentUuid":"1cd11fac-3ef6-4a18-824b-2065083850ba","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgER8mSLsLdq9A6GESW1M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The retry attempt on the embedding job failed again, but that's a minor issue since the corrupt image would fail OCR regardless of retries. I'll just note this in the report.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1526,"cache_read_input_tokens":205269,"output_tokens":531,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":41},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1526,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":531,"cache_read_input_tokens":205269,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1526,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1526},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[{"type":"thinking_dropped","path":"messages.2.content.0","reason":"prefix_binding_mismatch"}],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1996,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgER8k4VWMStF3BrawMR8","requestRef":"bdf6862b-0535-4a68-ad22-34d2774631bb","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"713ea4f7-f43b-4909-9559-7beebd91933d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T00:14:08.015Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"low","perTurnEffort":"low","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"713ea4f7-f43b-4909-9559-7beebd91933d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgER8mSLsLdq9A6GESW1M","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Round 5 confirms both fixes in the real app, and nothing new broke.\n\n- **OCR keeps cards in place:** an existing image's OCR finished and the other cards stayed exactly where they were. That image's last-updated time didn't change either.\n- **Corrupt image is handled quietly:** no error dialog appeared, and its OCR, thumbnail and embedding jobs failed cleanly. The item kept its image card with its filename and a failure state.\n- **Sanity checks still pass:** OCR text became searchable, the video poster showed and playback and seeking worked, and Archive and Restore worked.\n\nOne small gap: \"Try again\" in the item view retries only one failed job, and for the corrupt image it picked the embedding job. So retrying OCR specifically from the app is still untested. For a corrupt image the retry would fail again anyway, so I'm leaving it as is.\n\nAcross all five rounds, everything on the original list has now been checked in the real app except two things:\n- an interrupted thumbnail job recovering after a restart, because jobs always finished before the app could be closed;\n- the real Windows file picker, clipboard and drag gestures, which were simulated instead.\n\n#174 is still a draft, stacked on #170, with all fixes pushed. It's ready for your review. Before/after screenshots for the PR body are still to add; Luna's evidence is in `C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\perf-e2e-*\\` if you'd like me to use some."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1526,"cache_read_input_tokens":205269,"output_tokens":531,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":41},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"se