{"parentUuid":"71aacaad-0001-47b7-936b-7847b9fef04a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"057175f3-8a73-4a85-9bec-eccb45146417","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0133ZPn1Dy6Y2wHpbbQZWhUD","type":"tool_result","content":"drwxr-xr-x 1 chris 197610 0 Oct 20 18:23 perf-e2e\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 chris 197610 0 Oct 20 18:28 perf-e2e-2\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 chris 197610 0 Oct 20 18:42 perf-e2e-3\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 chris 197610 0 Oct 20 19:56 perf-e2e-4\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 chris 197610 0 Oct 20 20:13 perf-e2e-5\n== /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/perf-e2e-2\ninkling-registry-backup.reg\n== /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/perf-e2e-3\nadd-panel.png\nafter-ocr.png\nafter-restart.png\narchive-settings.mjs\narchive-settings.png\nbefore-restart.png\nbuttons.mjs\nclose.mjs\ncurrent.mjs\nfinal-app.png\nfinish-current.mjs\nfinish-marker.mjs\nfirst-renderer.png\nflow.mjs\nincremental-capture.png\nincremental-check.mjs\nincremental-survivor.mjs\nincremental.mjs\ninkling-registry-backup.reg\ninspect-file.mjs\nlaunch-test.mjs\nmake-large.mjs\nmarker-second.png\nmarker-unique.png\nnative-after-ocr.png\nnative-app-final.png\nocr-search.png\nocr-source.png\nocr.mjs\nonboard.mjs\npost-restart.mjs\nprobe.mjs\nregressions.mjs\nrelaunch.mjs\nrestart-capture.mjs\nrestart-large-1.jpg\nrestart-large-2.jpg\nrestart-large-3.jpg\nrun.json\nsave-upload.mjs\nsearch-ocr.mjs\nstderr-relaunch.log\nstderr.log\nstdout-relaunch.log\nstdout.log\n== /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/perf-e2e-4\narchive-state.png\narchived-running-job.png\nidle-after-65s.png\nidle-after-change.png\nidle-before.png\nincremental-after.png\nincremental-after2.png\nincremental-before.png\nincremental-processing.png\nincremental-processing2.png\ninitial.png\nscreen-after-restart.png\nscreen-stuck.png\nsearch-after-job.png\nsearch-before-job.png\nseeded.png\nvideo-detail-playing.png\n== /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/chat-images/perf-e2e-5\narchive-video.log\narchive-video.mjs\narchive-video.png\ncapture-corrupt.mjs\ncheck1-after.png\ncheck1-before-fullscreen.png\ncheck1-before.png\ncheck1-during-fullscreen.png\ncheck1-during2-fullscreen.png\ncheck1-settled.log\ncheck1-settled.mjs\ncheck1-settled.png\ncheck1.log\ncheck1.mjs\nclear-search.mjs\nclose-app.mjs\ncorrupt-after-capture.png\ncorrupt-before-save.png\ncorrupt-capture.log\ncorrupt-inspector-failed.png\ncorrupt-jobs.log\ncorrupt-retried-failed.png\ncorrupt-retried-processing.png\ncorrupt-retry-final-fullscreen.png\ncorrupt-retry-final.png\ncorrupt-retry.log\ncorrupt-settled.png\ncorrupt-watch-00.png\ncorrupt-watch-01.png\ncorrupt-watch-02.png\ncorrupt-watch-03.png\ncorrupt-watch-04.png\ncorrupt-watch-05.png\ncorrupt-watch-06.png\ncorrupt-watch-07.png\ncorrupt-watch-08.png\ncorrupt-watch-09.png\ncorrupt-watch-10.png\ncorrupt-watch-11.png\ncorrupt-watch-12.png\ncorrupt-watch-13.png\ncorrupt-watch-14.png\ncorrupt-watch-15.png\ncorrupt-watch-16.png\ncorrupt-watch-17.png\ncorrupt-watch-18.png\ncorrupt-watch-19.png\ncorrupt-watch-20.png\ncorrupt-watch-21.png\ncorrupt-watch-22.png\ncorrupt-watch-23.png\ncorrupt-watch-contact-sheet.png\ndevtools-port.txt\nfinal-running-fullscreen.png\ngood-ocr-search-settled.png\ngood-ocr-search.log\ngood-ocr-search.mjs\ngood-ocr-search.png\nincremental-before.png\nincremental-processing.png\nincremental-test.mjs\ninitial-fullscreen.png\ninitial.png\ninspect-corrupt.mjs\ninspect.mjs\nlaunch.mjs\nregistry-after-restore.reg\nregistry-before.reg\nrestore-video.mjs\nretry-corrupt.mjs\nretry-final.mjs\nretry-watch-00.png\nretry-watch-01.png\nretry-watch-02.png\nretry-watch-03.png\nretry-watch-04.png\nretry-watch-05.png\nretry-watch-06.png\nretry-watch-07.png\nretry-watch-08.png\nretry-watch-09.png\nretry-watch-10.png\nretry-watch-11.png\nretry-watch-12.png\nretry-watch-13.png\nretry-watch-14.png\nretry-watch-15.png\nretry-watch-16.png\nretry-watch-17.png\nretry-watch-18.png\nretry-watch-19.png\nretry-watch-20.png\nretry-watch-21.png\nretry-watch-22.png\nretry-watch-23.png\nretry-watch-contact-sheet.png\nrun.json\nsampler-pid.txt\nsampler-retry-pid.txt\nscreenshot-sampler-retry.ps1\nscreenshot-sampler.ps1\nsearch-settled.mjs\nstate.mjs\nstderr.log\nstdout.log\nvideo-detail-playing.png\nvideo-test.log\nvideo-test.mjs\nwait-corrupt.mjs\n<!-- entire-trail-link-start -->\nhttps://entire.io/gh/Squidys-Tools/inkling/trails/133\n<!-- entire-trail-link-end -->\n\nStacked on #170.\n\nFour slow paths:\n- Capture sent file bytes over IPC as a number array, and the card waited for the thumbnail resize before it appeared.\n- Local video cards loaded the whole video file just to show a frame.\n- The asset protocol read every file fully into memory before sending a byte.\n- The Settings Archive tab read every archived item, with its processing state, whenever Settings opened, and then rendered every card.\n\n**Capture.** Bytes now travel as a `Uint8Array`. Capture reads only the image header to check the image and get its size, then saves and returns. The thumbnail comes from a queued `image_thumbnail` job on a second worker, so OCR and model loading can't delay it. The existing queue handles leases and recovery after a restart. Until the thumbnail lands, the card shows the original image.\n\n**Video posters.** A `video_poster` job on the same worker makes a poster with Electron's `nativeImage.createThumbnailFromPath`, which uses the shell thumbnailer and adds no dependency. Existing videos get theirs from an idle backfill. Grid cards no longer contain a `<video>` element. A video without a poster shows the typed video card instead of an empty dark tile.\n\n**Assets.** The asset handler moved to `electron/asset-response.mjs`. It streams files and supports single byte-range requests (206 and 416), with `ETag` and `Last-Modified` but no `Cache-Control`, because thumbnails are rewritten in place. The `app` scheme now has the `stream` privilege so media can seek. The path containment checks are unchanged.\n\n**Archive.** The archive is read only while its tab is shown. Its grid mounts only the rows near the scroll position and keeps the CSS grid layout and tab order.\n\n**Tests.** There are focused tests for each part. The one failing test in `storage.test.ts` (\"portable precedence\", a Windows path separator) already fails on main.\n\n**Not done:**\n- No run in the real app yet. Before/after screenshots of the video card and the Archive tab still need to be added.\n- A video card gets shorter when its poster arrives.\n- The Archive tab count shows only after the tab has been opened.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/Squidys-Tools/codesmith/inkling/pr/174?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1795124975&installation_model_id=432698&pr_number=174&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=Squidys-Tools%2Finkling&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FSquidys-Tools%2Finkling%2Fpull%2F174&signature=d24d2ddc15c08a5d43942499a535dcdd3f9fbee5de8f7327c7098f92384728bd\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<sup