{"parentUuid":"2989dd52-6470-463b-b9d5-dcecc0d63b5f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"86f2a894-4163-49e7-9b2c-39677dae6c43","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"okay some things I noticed that really gotta be fixed in the app: \n\nfor some reason the back button does not work when entering some items details. the first item in the seeded demo library when you run the desktop app command, I clicked on it, it opened details, and when I used the back button nothing happens. this seems to work with all the other items though. \n\na bug with text rendering and in general all that content circled needs to move down and the search bar and back and forth buttons shouldnt show for this screen [Image: image.png; ref=image_220c14f8-ff98-45e8-954e-16f72626c93b] \n\ntons of bugs and issue with this screen, and it seems universal [Image: image.png; ref=image_6671d6fd-713d-4e56-a78b-c2340cf794b5] \n\nin spaces where there is no content those buttons and ui in red need to be removed and the general box that says nothing is surfaced needs to move down more [Image: image.png; ref=image_0d928f78-5057-42d8-852c-e5fbfd2c805c] \n\noh yeah and way too much whitespace in the sidebar in this area and the mascot is pitifully tiny [Image: image.png; ref=image_9de9e945-265a-4a0b-ab4d-266598cda4d1] \n\nalso ive decided I dont want content in the library grid by default going all the way up to the blue line, I want it to go at max by default to the magenta/red line [Image: image.png; ref=image_74f2f8fc-a831-4cf1-b10f-d4313f38f567] \n\nget rid of the pointed text in settings but leave the highlighted [Image: image.png; ref=image_2b96aa6c-7280-45ed-a629-246d8cf31877] \n\ngeneral should also be above library in settings [Image: image.png; ref=image_92b485bf-9fcd-47eb-abfc-6919a3603b77]\n\n<t3_context version=\"1\">\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_220c14f8-ff98-45e8-954e-16f72626c93b\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 183472\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-6474ae85-11c2-4759-bdc3-a861dec66c1f\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_6671d6fd-713d-4e56-a78b-c2340cf794b5\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 640547\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-fbed8955-7f52-4a34-ba4d-47ae35ce419c\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_0d928f78-5057-42d8-852c-e5fbfd2c805c\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 83435\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-56fa1dfa-3cd2-49b8-9202-056831574dd5\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_9de9e945-265a-4a0b-ab4d-266598cda4d1\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 850668\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-1cdc7875-4269-4ec4-b646-aa30a73382ae\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_74f2f8fc-a831-4cf1-b10f-d4313f38f567\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 836781\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-784c1d13-7159-4a37-9689-c8c0beab299f\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_2b96aa6c-7280-45ed-a629-246d8cf31877\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 120786\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-4889e2ac-0ec1-48da-b3ce-1e1304290dd6\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_92b485bf-9fcd-47eb-abfc-6919a3603b77\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 122393\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-18cc820