{"parentUuid":"0d58d22d-9909-4634-8ab2-fa05a73c3123","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEZsuXsvjniMsaxNne1a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've pushed the changes and am putting together the final report along with screenshots.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":900,"cache_read_input_tokens":185980,"output_tokens":873,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":900,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":873,"cache_read_input_tokens":185980,"cache_creation_input_tokens":900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":900},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6346,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEZsuDmx9kfnv2PSBkXA","requestRef":"29609d80-f0e2-4953-9620-52675a448ef7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e281aaca-4756-432c-ab3c-a12d30b30dcf","timestamp":"2026-10-21T02:08:52.149Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"e281aaca-4756-432c-ab3c-a12d30b30dcf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEZsuXsvjniMsaxNne1a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed all eight things you flagged. They're pushed to the redesign PR #170 as `e09816e`. I checked them in the Electron shell (`dev:app` with the demo library), and Biome and the typecheck pass on the changed files.\n\n- **Back button on the first item:** this was a real bug. To close an item, the app first scrolls its card into view. The first card was partly hidden under the toolbar and the list couldn't scroll any higher, so it waited forever. It now stops when the list can't move. Back closes the first item now.\n- **Item view:** it now fills the same area as the grid. It no longer covers the sidebar's collapse tab, and the gaps above and below are close to even.\n- **Grid top:** the first row now starts just below the toolbar, at your magenta line. Cards still slide under the toolbar when you scroll.\n- **Serendipity:** back/forward and search are gone. The \"12 older saves in this walk\" row was the overlapping text, and I removed it; \"28 older items left\" already says the same thing. The content also sits lower.\n- **Empty Spaces:** the view toggle and search are hidden, and the \"Nothing surfaced yet\" box sits lower.\n- **Sidebar:** the mascot is drawn at full size, with less space above it and below it.\n- **Settings:** General is now above Library, and \"Everything stays on this machine.\" is gone. The version line stays.\n\n![Grid](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes\\01-grid.png)\n![Item view](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes\\02-item-view.png)\n![Serendipity](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes\\03-serendipity.png)\n![Empty Space](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes\\04-empty-space.png)\n![Settings](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes\\05-settings.png)\n\nDecisions for you:\n- **Settings still opens on Library.** I only changed the order, so General is listed first but isn't the tab you land on. I can make it open on General if you'd like.\n- **An empty smart Space still says \"Try another word\" and shows \"Clear search\"**, even when nothing was searched. I can hide the link and reword that copy when there's no search.\n\nThe perf PR #174 is stacked on this branch and doesn't have this commit yet. I'll merge it in there when you want."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":900,"cache_read_input_tokens":185980,"output_tokens":873,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":16},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":900,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":873,"cache_read_input_tokens":185980,"cache_creation_input_tokens":900,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":900},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgEZsuDmx9kfnv2PSBkXA","requestRef":"29609d80-f0e2-4953-9620-52675a448ef7","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"94cef96a-4533-4057-9422-0f5cc1c97c5e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T02:08:53.039Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
