{"parentUuid":"ffca3abe-c87c-4116-9cee-c620e0294b5f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c1e09a4f-56d0-4a87-b2c6-9f80126953b4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"can we put the inkling name there pls [Image: image.png; ref=image_cc5dcece-f640-422c-8121-a3bad4175dcd] . also when I hit the zoom in and zoom out buttons here it goes in absolutely massive increments so make them like variable increments because I also want to be able to control and mouse wheel scroll to zoom in and out as well as mouse button click to pan [Image: image.png; ref=image_8328cc1d-b906-4f30-9fdc-7866b7fc5093] . \n\nalso could you make the styling and look of this better thats atrocius [Image: image.png; ref=image_fbe7cf94-908d-45ee-b546-5873ecd4d333] \n\nalso when archiving an item from the details view it should use the same closing animation as if you were just closing the item but the item fades away instead of returning to its original spot instead of just insta-flashing back to the grid like it does now.\n\nalso tbh just get rid of the back and forth in the items detail view [Image: image.png; ref=image_89e1e7c8-dbca-4bc9-8448-2878aeb92345]\n\n<t3_context version=\"1\">\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_cc5dcece-f640-422c-8121-a3bad4175dcd\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 770662\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-df1be3c2-b57e-4a0a-9d59-c658a1a54fe7\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_8328cc1d-b906-4f30-9fdc-7866b7fc5093\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 617309\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-cbf04764-6985-417b-966b-d35e7448dd48\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_fbe7cf94-908d-45ee-b546-5873ecd4d333\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 614858\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-34ff426f-d929-4e99-b626-4de13bac4318\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_89e1e7c8-dbca-4bc9-8448-2878aeb92345\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 251691\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-c6133172-d150-4198-a6f8-b9642bd62eaa\n</context>\n</t3_context>\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-df1be3c2-b57e-4a0a-9d59-c658a1a54fe7.png]\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-cbf04764-6985-417b-966b-d35e7448dd48.png]\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-34ff426f-d929-4e99-b626-4de13bac4318.png]\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-c6133172-d150-4198-a6f8-b9642bd62eaa.png]"}]},"uuid":"54ac3dc7-1f3c-4170-b5ed-4b97be2e78e7","timestamp":"2026-10-21T02:29:34.315Z","imagePasteIds":[20,21,22,23],"permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":136},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
