{"parentUuid":"316d8811-c167-4533-ada7-4d888a860a5e","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01EzS4LDFoHmQAFzzxTRtda1","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ce8b8d39-a4c3-43bc-94ca-36770d0804a2","timestamp":"2026-10-21T02:42:00.956Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"ce8b8d39-a4c3-43bc-94ca-36770d0804a2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEcQXtjBaHS9SL2qJDFT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All five changes are in and pushed to #170 as `dc579b9`. I checked each one in the Electron shell.\n\n- **Name in the sidebar:** \"inkling\" now sits beside the mascot, set in the same serif as the headings.\n- **Zoom:**\n  - **Buttons:** each press now scales by 25% of the current zoom instead of doubling. On the lantern photo that went 11% → 13% → 16% → 21%. Zoom runs smoothly from fit up to 3200%.\n  - **Ctrl + mouse wheel:** zooms in and out around the cursor, and the window itself no longer zooms.\n  - **Panning:** dragging with the left or middle mouse button pans the image once it's zoomed in. The middle button no longer starts the browser's auto-scroll.\n- **Space picker:** it's now a small menu titled \"Keep in a Space\", with one row per Space and a check on the ones the item is in. Clicking elsewhere or pressing Esc closes it, and Esc closes only the menu, not the item view.\n- **Archiving from the item view:** the view now shrinks slightly and fades out, and the item is archived after the fade. If archiving fails, the view comes back.\n- **Back/forward buttons:** removed from the item view. Alt+←/→ and the mouse's side buttons still step back and forward through history.\n\n![Sidebar wordmark](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes-2\\01-sidebar.png)\n![Space picker, zoomed to 37%](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes-2\\03-space-menu.png)\n![Archive mid-fade](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes-2\\04-archive-mid.png)\n![After archive](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\ui-fixes-2\\05-archive-done.png)\n\nI added a small test file for the zoom maths (`imageZoom.test.ts`), and it passes. Biome and the typecheck are clean on the changed files.\n\nThe perf PR #174 still doesn't include this commit or the last one. I'll bring both over when you want."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":660,"cache_read_input_tokens":239031,"output_tokens":755,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":660,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":755,"cache_read_input_tokens":239031,"cache_creation_input_tokens":660,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":660},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEcQXZeC2VpuZALVJ5nA","requestRef":"6c0147df-1e39-4c97-bc0a-d08bdec153cf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"905bf179-f822-4ab2-95fc-dd2acd4b499d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T02:42:00.956Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
