ve fade, wordmark\ne09816e fix(library): QA pass on item view, Serendipity, empty Spaces and sidebar\n48de5cd fix(desktop): unpack OCR worker deps and open at 1280x720\n69e3641 perf(settings): show cached library size and refresh it in the background\nfb487dd fix(library): QA fixes for pinned search, item view band and sidebar mark\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.305","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
