{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T04:07:17.668Z"}
{"parentUuid":"1b0e3790-1dac-474c-a42e-0243d6128c95","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEivCsmjQzL4b3C5748k","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a notable shift — using liquid-dom with WebGPU and the HTML-in-Canvas API, applied only to the floating chrome elements like the search bar and zoom pill, while panels and sidebar stay solid. Rendering should happen on demand, redrawing only on scroll and canvas paint events rather than a continuous animation loop, with thumbnails appearing only under the glass effect.\n\nI need a CSS backdrop-filter fallback with blur and a rim effect for when WebGPU or the API isn't available, and I'm aiming for the look of fluidglass's shader with edge light and refraction but skipping its fluid simulation. There are untested risks around weaker laptop GPUs, high refresh rates, real scroll input, and virtualized grids.\n\nGiven the request to apply this to all translucent buttons and make liquid glass the default without regressing performance much, I should check whether the repo already has groundwork for this — searching for existing liquid, glass, backdrop-filter, or CanvasDrawElement code, especially since the branch name suggests a glass-surface feature might already be underway.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2636,"cache_read_input_tokens":64398,"output_tokens":788,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":409},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2636,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":788,"cache_read_input_tokens":64398,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2636,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2636},"type":"mess