{"type":"last-prompt","lastPrompt":"check the paper file on how to implement the liquid glass in the app https://app.paper.design/file/01M51FDW8EAY40ZQSN6NKJAAYW/p-6-0  inplement it in all the buttons that are translucent right now and…","leafUuid":"3f19c063-0f04-4a3f-a1dd-c6f426fd4c2a","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7"}
