{"parentUuid":"8c3f78a3-a689-47cc-8a36-11b220d80766","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEkRxwaYKx8JRbBP8aGt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I notice the npm package hasn't been updated since the fix merged into master, so I'm weighing whether to pull the fix in via a git dependency pointing to the specific commit, though the monorepo/pnpm workspace structure complicates installing just the subpackage that way.\n\nA cleaner option is using `bun patch` against the published 0.1.1 package — I can create a patch that updates the texture copy call sites directly in the compiled dist/index.js to match the new signature, which is minimal, reviewable, and avoids build tooling issues. I just need to check the actual fix commit's diff so the patch mirrors it exactly, focusing only on the signature change rather than other unrelated changes merged since then.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1706,"cache_read_input_tokens":244456,"output_tokens":815,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":534},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1706,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":815,"cache_read_input_tokens":244456,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1706,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1706},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8132,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEkRxajn931aTJPHDqEJ","requestRef":"da87f4bc-9880-4dcc-941b-968a3305a247","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"dd568425-5589-4e3f-