{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"cb77a9942dfb5a44e3522bebb6171336094472b219c2717c09ba23cc57b891c9","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm figuring out the patch workflow for @liquid-dom/core: run bun patch to unlink it from cache for editing, make the changes, then commit with bun patch --commit which generates the patch file and updates package.json's patchedDependencies.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Applying the upstream fix with `bun patch`:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ToX3iq5JSpwVQJY2i8DW1P","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && timeout 120 bun patch @liquid-dom/core 2>&1 | tail -3 && for f in node_modules/@liquid-dom/core/dist/index.js node_modules/@liquid-dom/core/dist/index.cjs; do python - \"$f\" <<'EOF'\nimport io, sys, re\np = sys.argv[1]\ns = io.open(p, encoding='utf-8', newline='').read()\npat = re.compile(r'this\\.device\\.queue\\.copyElementImageToTexture\\(\\n(\\s+)entry\\.html\\.host,\\n\\s+entry\\.deviceWidth,\\n\\s+entry\\.deviceHeight,\\n\\s+\\{ texture: (entry\\.\\w+) \\}\\n(\\s+)\\);')\ndef sub(m):\n    i, tex, close = m.group(1), m.group(2), m.group(3)\n    return (f'this.device.queue.copyElementImageToTexture(\\n{i}{{ source: entry.html.host }},\\n'\n            f'{i}{{ destination: {{ texture: {tex} }}, width: entry.deviceWidth, height: entry.deviceHeight }}\\n{close});')\ns2, n = pat.subn(sub, s)\nassert n == 2, (p, n)\nio.open(p, 'w', encoding='utf-8', newline='').write(s2)\nprint(p, n)\nEOF\ndone && grep -n \"copyElementImageToTexture(\" -A 3 node_modules/@liquid-dom/core/dist/index.js && timeout 120 bun patch --commit node_modules/@liquid-dom/core 2>&1 | tail -3 && git status --short && cat patches/*.patch | head -60 && grep -n -A3 \"patchedDependencies\" package.json","description":"Patch liquid-dom to the current copy signature"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
