{"parentUuid":"0306aa55-6f4f-4713-a455-b50c14acb2bd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEXwgcdbpUmj1VWWWWoF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added a screenshots section to the #174 description: https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/174\n\nIt has four shots from Luna's last test run in the packaged app:\n- the grid, with the video card showing its poster and the cards still in place after text recognition finished\n- the Archive tab\n- the video playing and seeking\n- a corrupt image that showed no error dialog and stayed in its spot\n\nAll four are \"after\" shots only. Luna never captured the app before this change, so the description says that in one line. If you want real before/after pairs, I can build the base branch and take matching shots.\n\nThe images are hosted in a secret gist, the same way #170's are. I also removed \"No run in the real app yet\" from the \"Not done\" list, since the app has now been tested."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":770,"cache_read_input_tokens":63510,"output_tokens":243,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":770,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":243,"cache_read_input_tokens":63510,"cache_creation_input_tokens":770,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":770},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEXwgKGdt52ySpJSZW2P","requestRef":"283774f5-4af2-4680-8ad9-2d37d5ff312f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"358c173c-1612-4963-8782-c4f7f